orm to start accepting payments.'=>'使用“Square”字段时，必须启用 Square 支付功能。请在此表单中启用 Square 支付，以便开始接受付款。','Connect With Square'=>'与 Square 建立联系','Square account connection is required when using the Square field. Connect your Square account to start accepting payments.'=>'使用 Square 字段时，需要连接 Square 账户。请连接您的 Square 账户，以便开始接收付款。','Accept PayPal, Venmo, and credit cards with trusted buyer protection.'=>'支持 PayPal、Venmo 和信用卡支付，并提供值得信赖的买家保障。','Smart Editing'=>'智能编辑','Make changes with WPForms AI'=>'使用 WPForms AI 进行修改','Enable Lite Connect today to start storing entries. When you’re ready to manage your entries inside WordPress, just <a href="%1$s" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Upgrade to Pro</a> and we’ll import them in seconds!'=>'立即启用 Lite Connect，开始存储条目。当您准备好在 WordPress 中管理这些条目时，只需 <a href="%1$s" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">升级到 Pro 版</a>，我们将在几秒钟内完成导入！','Here’s how your forms performed this past week.<br>Below is a breakdown of submissions by form.'=>'以下是您过去一周表单的运行情况。<br>下面是按表单分类的提交情况明细。','Enable Lite Connect'=>'启用 Lite Connect','Enable Lite Connect today to start storing entries. When you’re ready to manage your entries inside WordPress, just upgrade to Pro and we’ll import them in seconds!'=>'立即启用 Lite Connect，开始存储条目。当您准备好在 WordPress 中管理这些条目时，只需升级到 Pro 版，我们将在几秒钟内将它们导入！','Your entries are not being backed up.'=>'‌您的数据未被备份。','Existing Page'=>'现有页面','How Would You Like to Publish Your Form?'=>'您希望如何发布您的表单？','Demo'=>'演示','Disable storage IP addresses and User Agent on all forms. If unchecked, then this can be managed on a form-by-form basis inside the form builder under Settings → General'=>'在所有表单中禁用存储 IP 地址和用户代理。如果未勾选此选项，则可在表单构建器中的“设置”→“常规”下针对每个表单单独进行管理。','Lite Connect is saving your entries securely in the cloud. Upgrade to Pro to keep them permanently and manage all your entries right inside WordPress.'=>'Lite Connect 会将您的条目安全地保存在云端。升级到 Pro 版，即可永久保存这些条目，并在 WordPress 内直接管理所有条目。','Your entries are being backed up, but only for one year.'=>'您的记录正在被备份，但仅保留一年。','Here’s how your forms performed this past week. Below is a breakdown of submissions by form.'=>'以下是您过去一周的表单表现情况。下面按表单分类列出了提交情况。','Your Weekly WPForms Summary'=>'您的每周 WPForms 摘要','You can also <a href="%s" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">embed your form manually</a> in any page or post.'=>'您还可以 <a href="%s" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">手动将表单嵌入</a> 到任何页面或文章中。','Shortcode copied to clipboard'=>'短代码已复制到剪贴板','Copy shortcode to clipboard'=>'将短代码复制到剪贴板','Copy the shortcode and use it in any page builder or template.'=>'复制该短代码，并在任何页面构建器或模板中使用它。','Copy the Form\'s Shortcode'=>'复制表单的短代码','Add to a New Page'=>'添加到新页面','Embed in an Existing Page'=>'嵌入现有页面','Copy a shortcode to use anywhere.'=>'复制一个短代码，即可在任何地方使用。','Create a new page for your form.'=>'为您的表单创建一个新页面。','New Page'=>'新增页面','Add to a page you\'ve already created.'=>'添加到你已经创建的页面中。','Disable User Details'=>'禁用用户详情','Disable user tracking cookies. This will disable the Related Entries feature and the Form Abandonment addon.'=>'禁用用户跟踪 Cookie。这将禁用“相关文章”功能和“表单放弃”插件。','Disable User Cookies'=>'禁用用户 Cookie','<a href="%s" class="wpforms-btn wpforms-btn-md wpforms-btn-light-grey wpforms-stripe-switch-accounts-btn">Switch Accounts</a>'=>'<a href="%s" class="wpforms-btn wpforms-btn-md wpforms-btn-light-grey wpforms-stripe-switch-accounts-btn">切换账户</a>','Configuring conditional logic...'=>'正在配置条件逻辑……','Generating calculations...'=>'正在生成计算结果...','Updating form settings...'=>'正在更新表单设置...','Generating field changes...'=>'正在生成字段更改...','No changes needed.'=>'无需修改。','Give negative feedback'=>'给予负面反馈','Give positive feedback'=>'给予积极反馈','Your AI edit didn\'t run because the form couldn\'t be saved. Please try again.'=>'您的 AI 编辑操作未能执行，因为表单无法保存。请重试。','Restore point not saved'=>'还原点未保存','Changes Saved'=>'更改已保存','You\'ve hit your daily AI request limit.'=>'您已达到每日 AI 请求上限。','Retry'=>'重试','Great response!'=>'反响很大！','Missing session ID.'=>'缺少会话 ID。','You are not allowed to edit this form.'=>'您无法编辑此表单。','Invalid scope.'=>'无效范围。','Select previous form plugin'=>'选择上一个表单插件','Upload WPForms export file'=>'上传 WPForms 导出文件','Import Forms'=>'导入表单','Export Templates'=>'导出模板','Auto-saved before AI Choices'=>'在“AI 选择”之前自动保存','Add a GDPR consent checkbox'=>'添加一个 GDPR 同意复选框','Group the fields into sections'=>'将字段分组到各个部分中','Change the submit button text to "Get Started"'=>'将“提交”按钮的文字更改为“开始”','Make all fields required'=>'将所有字段设为必填','Send an email notification to the customer'=>'向客户发送电子邮件通知','How can I improve this form?'=>'我该如何改进这份表格？','Example questions'=>'示例问题','Changes made. What\'s next?'=>'修改已完成。接下来该做什么？','All set! Anything else to adjust?'=>'都准备好了！还有其他需要调整的地方吗？','Done! Want to make more changes?'=>'完成！还想做更多修改吗？','Changes applied! Need anything else?'=>'更改已应用！还有其他需要吗？','An error occurred while editing form.'=>'编辑表单时发生错误。','Stop response'=>'停止响应','Describe the changes you would like to make...'=>'请描述您希望进行哪些更改……','What would you like to change? Describe it in plain language and we\'ll update your form fields, settings, and more.'=>'您希望做出哪些更改？请用通俗易懂的语言描述，我们将据此更新您的表单字段、设置等内容。','Auto-saved before Smart Edit'=>'在“智能编辑”之前自动保存','Create Page'=>'创建页面','Add to Page'=>'添加到页面','Powerful, Flexible Entry Imports'=>'功能强大且灵活的条目导入功能','Switching from another form plugin? Moving entries between forms? With WPForms Pro, you can import entries from any CSV file. Whether it\'s exported from another WordPress form plugin, pulled from your CRM, or built by hand. Map your data to the right fields, and every submission lands exactly where it belongs. No lost leads, no manual re-entry, no messy migrations. '=>'正在从其他表单插件切换过来？需要在不同表单之间转移表单数据？使用 WPForms Pro，您可以从任何 CSV 文件导入表单数据。无论这些数据是导自其他 WordPress 表单插件、从您的 CRM 系统提取，还是手动创建的。将数据映射到相应的字段，每条提交的数据都会精准地归入对应的位置。不会丢失潜在客户，无需手动重新输入，也无需进行繁琐的数据迁移。 ','A <a href="#" class="wpforms-panel-content-revisions-link">revision</a> has been automatically created.'=>'已自动生成一个 <a href="#" class="wpforms-panel-content-revisions-link">修订版本</a>。','Need to back up your form data, share it with your team, or move entries to another form? WPForms Pro lets you export entries from any form as a CSV or XLSX file. Choose which fields to include, filter by date range, and download a clean file ready for spreadsheets, CRMs, or re-importing into WPForms.'=>'需要备份表单数据、与团队共享，还是将表单条目转移到另一个表单？WPForms Pro 允许您将任何表单的条目导出为 CSV 或 XLSX 文件。您可以选择要包含的字段，按日期范围进行筛选，并下载一个格式规范的文件，该文件可直接用于电子表格、CRM 系统，或重新导入到 WPForms 中。','Re-import Into Any WPForms Form'=>'重新导入到任何 WPForms 表单中','Schedule Automated Exports'=>'定时自动导出','Search and Export Matching Entries'=>'搜索并导出匹配条目','Filter by Date Range'=>'按日期范围筛选','Choose Specific Fields to Include'=>'选择要包含的特定字段','Export as CSV or XLSX'=>'导出为 CSV 或 XLSX 格式','Export Entries'=>'导出条目','In order to preview your form as a Lead Form, you must first enable the setting.'=>'若要以“潜在客户表单”的形式预览您的表单，您必须先启用该设置。','Create engaging experiences.'=>'打造引人入胜的体验。','Lead Forms'=>'潜在客户表单','Lead Form'=>'潜在客户表单','In order to preview your form as a Form Page, you must first enable the setting.'=>'若要以表单页面形式预览表单，您必须先启用该设置。','Build distraction-free forms.'=>'构建无干扰表单','Form Landing Pages'=>'表单登录页面','Form Landing Page'=>'表单登录页面','In order to preview your form as a Conversational Form, you must first enable the setting.'=>'若要以“对话式表单”的形式预览您的表单，您必须先启用该设置。','Make forms feel more natural.'=>'让表单操作更自然。','Conversational Form'=>'会话形式','Something went wrong while installing the addons. Please try again.'=>'安装扩展程序时出现错误。请重试。','Please select at least one addon to install.'=>'请至少选择一个插件进行安装。','In order to preview your form in other formats, you need to install addons. Would you like to install them now?'=>'若要以其他格式预览表单，您需要安装扩展程序。您现在要安装吗？','Addons Required'=>'所需插件','Paste new API key to replace'=>'粘贴新的 API 密钥以替换原有密钥','Remove Key'=>'移除密钥','View, Edit, Import, and Export'=>'查看、编辑、导入和导出','More Preview Options'=>'更多预览选项','Standard Form Preview'=>'标准表格预览','Move Entries Between Forms'=>'在表单之间移动条目','Preserve Your Complete History'=>'完整保存您的历史记录','Works with CRM Exports'=>'支持 CRM 导出功能','Map Columns to Form Fields'=>'将列映射到表单字段','Import from Any CSV File'=>'从任何 CSV 文件导入','Migrate From Other Plugins'=>'从其他插件迁移','Map Fields in Seconds'=>'以秒为单位映射字段','Seamless Migration From Other Plugins'=>'从其他插件无缝迁移','Import Entries'=>'导入条目','Full Control Over Your Data'=>'完全掌控您的数据','Dashboard'=>'仪表盘','CAPTCHAs can reduce form completions by up to 40%. ActiveLayer catches bots invisibly, without asking your visitors to prove they\'re human. Free tier available.'=>'验证码可能会使表单提交率降低多达40%。ActiveLayer 能在不被察觉的情况下拦截机器人，无需要求访客证明自己是真人。提供免费套餐。','Prefer no CAPTCHAs?'=>'不想输入验证码吗？','Better Way to Stop Spam'=>'更有效的反垃圾邮件方法','Activate ActiveLayer'=>'激活 ActiveLayer','Install ActiveLayer'=>'安装 ActiveLayer','AI-powered spam protection. No friction for real visitors, higher form conversions.'=>'基于人工智能的垃圾信息防护。对真实访客毫无阻碍，表单转化率更高。','The selected option is invalid.'=>'所选选项无效。','Unlock conditional logic, coupons, lower Stripe, PayPal and Square fees, and more.'=>'解锁条件逻辑、优惠券功能，降低 Stripe、PayPal 和 Square 的手续费，以及更多功能。','<strong>Entry Backup Failures Detected</strong><br>Some entry backups may not have been saved. This is usually caused by a scheduling issue on your site. Please <a href="%s" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">contact Support</a> so we can help resolve it and ensure your entries are protected.'=>'<strong>检测到条目备份失败</strong><br>部分条目备份可能未被保存。这通常是由于您站点上的计划任务问题所致。请 <a href="%s" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">联系支持团队</a>，以便我们协助解决问题并确保您的条目得到保护。','Looks like you have a problem with your webhooks configuration. Please check and confirm that you\'ve configured the WPForms webhooks in your PayPal account. This notice will disappear automatically when a new PayPal request comes in. See our <a href="%1$s" rel="nofollow noopener" target="_blank">documentation</a> for more information.'=>'看来您的 Webhooks 配置存在问题。请检查并确认您已在 PayPal 账户中配置了 WPForms Webhooks。当收到新的 PayPal 请求时，此提示将自动消失。更多信息请参阅我们的 <a href="%1$s" rel="nofollow noopener" target="_blank">文档</a>。','This subscription cannot be activated because there was an error with the capture API call.'=>'无法激活此订阅，因为扣款 API 调用出错。','This subscription cannot be activated because there was an error with the activation API call.'=>'无法激活此订阅，因为激活 API 调用出错。','This payment cannot be processed because there was an error with the create order API call.'=>'无法处理此付款，因为创建订单 API 调用出错。','This payment cannot be processed because it was declined by payment processor.'=>'无法处理此付款，因为付款处理程序拒绝了它。','This payment cannot be processed because there was an error with the capture order API call.'=>'无法处理此付款，因为获取订单 API 调用出错。','This payment cannot be processed because the account connection is expired or invalid.'=>'无法处理此付款，因为账户连接已过期或无效。','This payment cannot be processed because the account connection is missing.'=>'无法处理此付款，因为缺少账户连接。','Security check failed.'=>'安全检查失败。','If you haven\'t registered your domain yet, Apple Pay may not work properly. If this notice persists, please <a href="%1$s" rel="nofollow noopener" target="_blank">verify your domain registration.</a>'=>'如果您尚未注册域名，Apple Pay 可能无法正常使用。如果此提示持续出现，请 <a href="%1$s" rel="nofollow noopener" target="_blank">验证您的域名注册信息。</a>','Please enter a valid Fastlane billing address.'=>'请输入有效的 Fastlane 账单地址。','Please enter a valid Fastlane details.'=>'请输入有效的 Fastlane 信息。','No Fastlane account found with this email.'=>'未找到与该邮箱关联的 Fastlane 账户。','This payment cannot be processed because the payment amount is not set, or is set to an invalid amount.'=>'由于未设置付款金额，或者设置的金额无效，因此无法处理此笔付款。','Please enter the Card Holder Name.'=>'请输入持卡人姓名。','Please enter the CVV number.'=>'请输入 CVV 码。','PayPal Checkout is enabled. The form’s submit button has been replaced by PayPal’s smart buttons.'=>'已启用 PayPal 结账功能。表单的提交按钮已被 PayPal 的智能按钮取代。','Please enable at least one payment method.'=>'请至少启用一种支付方式。','Card Holder Name'=>'持卡人姓名','Expiration Date'=>'有效期','Customize Fastlane email placeholder and button text.'=>'自定义 Fastlane 电子邮件占位符和按钮文本。','Fastlane Labels'=>'Fastlane 标签','Additional credit card fields.'=>'其他信用卡字段。','Sublabels'=>'子标签','Visa'=>'Visa','Mastercard'=>'万事达卡','Discover'=>'探索','American Express'=>'美国运通','Select supported credit cards.'=>'请选择支持的信用卡。','Supported Credit Cards'=>'支持的信用卡','Pill'=>'标签','PayPal checkout button shape.'=>'PayPal 结账按钮的形状。','Button Shape'=>'按钮形状','Responsive'=>'响应式','PayPal checkout button size.'=>'PayPal 结账按钮的大小。','Button Size'=>'按钮大小','It seems to be request to PayPal PHP Listener method handler but the site is not configured to use it.'=>'检测到 PayPal PHP 监听器方法的请求，但当前站点尚未配置使用该功能。','This subscription cannot be processed because there was an error with the subscription processing API call.'=>'无法处理此订阅，因为订阅处理 API 调用出错。','This subscription cannot be created because there was an error with the create subscription API call.'=>'无法创建此订阅，因为创建订阅 API 调用出错。','This order cannot be created because there was an error with the create order API call.'=>'无法创建此订单，因为创建订单 API 调用出错。','Something went wrong. Please contact site administrator.'=>'出现了一些问题。请联系网站管理员。','Not specified'=>'未指定','Irregular activity detected. Your submission has been declined.'=>'检测到异常活动。您的提交已被拒绝。','Maestro'=>'Maestro','Select the default payment method.'=>'选择默认的支付方式。','Default Payment Method'=>'默认付款方式','Fastlane'=>'Fastlane','PayPal Checkout'=>'PayPal 结账','Select payment methods to enable.'=>'选择要启用的支付方式。','Supported Payment Methods'=>'支持的支付方式','PayPal checkout button color.'=>'PayPal 结账按钮的颜色。','Silver'=>'银色','Gold'=>'金色','White'=>'白色','Black'=>'黑色','Blue'=>'蓝色','Button Color'=>'按钮颜色','Rectangle'=>'矩形','Please enter a valid card number.'=>'请输入有效的卡号。','is not supported. Please enter the details for a supported credit card.'=>'不支持此卡。请输入支持的信用卡信息。','This payment cannot be processed because there was an error with 3D Secure authentication.'=>'由于 3D Secure 认证出现错误，无法处理此笔付款。','There was an error creating this subscription. Please contact the site administrator.'=>'创建此订阅时出现错误。请联系网站管理员。','API error:'=>'API错误：','There was an error processing this payment. Please contact the site administrator.'=>'处理此笔付款时出现错误。请联系网站管理员。','PayPal payment was canceled.'=>'PayPal 付款已被取消。','PayPal.js failed to load properly.'=>'PayPal.js 未能正确加载。','PayPal Commerce payments are disabled because details are missing from one of the recurring plans. Please ask your site administrator to check the form settings.'=>'由于其中一个定期付款计划缺少详细信息，PayPal Commerce 支付功能已被禁用。请联系您的网站管理员检查表单设置。','PayPal Commerce payments are disabled. Please enable at least one payment method in the form settings.'=>'PayPal Commerce 支付功能已禁用。请在表单设置中启用至少一种支付方式。','PayPal Commerce payments are not enabled in the form settings.'=>'表单设置中未启用 PayPal Commerce 支付功能。','PayPal Commerce payments are disabled because your connection is not set up correctly. Please ask your site administrator to check the connection settings.'=>'由于您的连接设置不正确，PayPal Commerce 支付功能已被禁用。请联系您的网站管理员检查连接设置。','PayPal Commerce payments are disabled. Please set up a connection with PayPal in your form’s settings.'=>'PayPal Commerce 支付功能已禁用。请在表单设置中配置与 PayPal 的连接。','This page is not secure. PayPal Commerce payments should be used for testing purposes only.'=>'该页面不安全。PayPal 商务支付只能用于测试目的。','Please enable at least one credit card type.'=>'请至少启用一种信用卡类型。','PayPal Commerce webhook ID created for the app. Created and configured automatically.'=>'为该应用生成的 PayPal Commerce Webhook ID。已自动创建并配置。','Webhooks Sandbox ID'=>'Webhooks 沙盒 ID','Choose how PayPal delivers events to WPForms. If REST API support is disabled for WordPress, use the PHP listener fallback. <a href="%s" rel="nofollow noopener" target="_blank">Learn more</a>.'=>'选择 PayPal 向 WPForms 发送事件的方式。如果 WordPress 禁用了 REST API 支持，请使用 PHP 监听器作为备用方案。<a href="%s" rel="nofollow noopener" target="_blank">了解更多</a>。','Disconnect PayPal Commerce account'=>'解除 PayPal Commerce 账户的绑定','Connect with PayPal Commerce'=>'连接 PayPal Commerce','Connect PayPal Commerce account'=>'连接 PayPal Commerce 账户','Billing Agreements'=>'账单协议','Partner Fees'=>'合伙人费用','Payments – Refunds'=>'付款 – 退款','Payments – Authorize & Capture'=>'支付 – 授权与扣款','Payments – Create / Capture'=>'支付 – 创建 / 采集','Connected to PayPal in <strong>%s</strong> mode.'=>'已通过 <strong>%s</strong> 模式连接到 PayPal。','Your account is currently not approved for vaulting, please review your account settings.'=>'您的账户目前尚未获得“Vaulting”功能授权，请检查您的账户设置。','Your Vaulting application is currently under review by PayPal, we will notify you once vaulting is approved or additional information is needed.'=>'您的 Vaulting 申请目前正在由 PayPal 审核，一旦 Vaulting 申请获批或需要补充信息，我们将通知您。','PayPal needs more info please go to account settings and complete the requested details to finish your vaulting application.'=>'PayPal 需要更多信息，请前往“账户设置”并填写所需信息，以完成您的金库申请。','Vaulting Status: <strong>%s</strong>'=>'跳跃状态：<strong>%s</strong>','Easily collect PayPal Checkout and credit card payments with PayPal Commerce. To get started, see our <a href="%s" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">PayPal Commerce documentation</a>.'=>'借助 PayPal Commerce，您可以轻松收取 PayPal Checkout 和信用卡付款。如需开始使用，请参阅我们的 <a href="%s" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">PayPal Commerce 文档</a>。','Prevent PayPal Commerce from processing live transactions. <a href="%s" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="wpforms-learn-more">Learn More</a>'=>'阻止 PayPal Commerce 处理实时交易。<a href="%s" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="wpforms-learn-more">了解更多</a>','Scopes Granted'=>'授予的范围','Account ID'=>'账户 ID','Primary Email'=>'主要邮箱','Something went wrong while performing the authorization request.'=>'执行授权请求时出现错误。','<p>Switching sandbox/live modes requires PayPal Commerce account reconnection.</p><p>Press the <em>"Connect with PayPal Commerce"</em> button after saving the settings to reconnect.</p>'=>'<p>切换沙盒模式和生产环境模式需要重新连接 PayPal Commerce 账户。</p><p>保存设置后，请点击 <em>“连接 PayPal Commerce”</em> 按钮以重新连接。</p>','Unexpected error while cancelling via processor: %s'=>'通过处理器取消时发生意外错误：%s','Subscription was cancelled remotely but not updated locally.'=>'订阅被远程取消，但未在本地更新。','Unexpected error while cancelling subscription: %s'=>'取消订阅时发生意外错误：%s','Subscription was cancelled on PayPal but failed to update locally.'=>'PayPal 上的套餐已取消，但无法在本地更新。','Subscription cancelled successfully.'=>'订阅已成功取消。','PayPal API subscription cancellation failed.'=>'PayPal API 订阅取消失败。','Subscription cannot be cancelled because its PayPal status is %s. Only Active or Suspended subscriptions can be cancelled.'=>'由于该订阅的 PayPal 状态为 %s，因此无法取消。只有“有效”或“暂停”状态的订阅才能取消。','Unable to fetch subscription details from PayPal. Please try again later.'=>'无法从 PayPal 获取订阅详情。请稍后再试。','Missing or invalid subscription information.'=>'订阅信息缺失或无效。','<strong>Pay-as-you-go Pricing</strong><br> 3%% fee per-transaction + PayPal Commerce fees. <a href="%s" target="_blank">Upgrade to Pro</a> to remove additional fees and unlock powerful features.'=>'<strong>按次付费定价</strong><br> 每笔交易收取 3%% 手续费 + PayPal Commerce 费用。<a href="%s" target="_blank">升级至 Pro</a> 以免除额外费用并解锁强大功能。','<strong>Pay-as-you-go Pricing</strong><br> 3%% fee per-transaction + PayPal Commerce fees. <a href="%s">Renew your license</a> to remove additional fees and unlock powerful features.'=>'<strong>按需付费定价</strong><br> 每笔交易收取 3%% 手续费 + PayPal Commerce 费用。<a href="%s">续订许可证</a>，以免除额外费用并解锁强大功能。','This is the endpoint WPForms expects PayPal to deliver events to. See <a href="%s" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">our PayPal webhooks guide</a> for details.'=>'这是 WPForms 期望 PayPal 将事件发送到的端点。详情请参阅 <a href="%s" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">我们的 PayPal Webhook 指南</a>。','PayPal uses webhooks to notify WPForms when events occur in your PayPal account. Please see <a href="%s" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">our documentation on PayPal webhooks</a> for full details.'=>'当您的 PayPal 账户中发生事件时，PayPal 会通过 webhook 通知 WPForms。有关详细信息，请参阅 <a href="%s" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">我们关于 PayPal webhook 的文档</a>。','PayPal Checkout support is disabled.'=>'PayPal Checkout 功能已禁用。','Credit Card field support is disabled.'=>'信用卡现场支持已禁用。','Primary email unconfirmed.'=>'主要电子邮件地址尚未确认。','Payments are disabled.'=>'支付功能已禁用。','Your PayPal Commerce connection is not valid. Please reconnect your PayPal Commerce account.'=>'您的 PayPal Commerce 连接无效。请重新连接您的 PayPal Commerce 账户。','Your PayPal Commerce client token is not valid. Please reconnect your PayPal Commerce account.'=>'您的 PayPal Commerce 客户端令牌无效。请重新连接您的 PayPal Commerce 账户。','Your PayPal Commerce access token is not valid. Please reconnect your PayPal Commerce account.'=>'您的 PayPal Commerce 访问令牌无效。请重新连接您的 PayPal Commerce 账户。','Your connection to PayPal Commerce is not complete. Please reconnect your PayPal Commerce account.'=>'您与 PayPal Commerce 的连接尚未完成。请重新连接您的 PayPal Commerce 账户。','Securely connect to PayPal Commerce with just a few clicks to begin accepting payments! <a href="%s" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="wpforms-learn-more">Learn More</a>'=>'只需点击几下，即可安全连接到 PayPal Commerce，开始接收付款！<a href="%s" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="wpforms-learn-more">了解更多</a>','There’s a temporary problem with the connection to PayPal Commerce. Please click <a href="%s" rel="noopener noreferrer">here</a> to try again.'=>'与 PayPal Commerce 的连接目前出现临时问题。请点击 <a href="%s" rel="noopener noreferrer">此处</a> 重试。','Braintree – Vault access'=>'Braintree – Vault access','Vault – Manage payment tokens'=>'Vault – Manage payment tokens','Vault – Read payment tokens'=>'Vault – Read payment tokens','<strong>Pay-as-you-go Pricing</strong><br>3%% fee per-transaction + PayPal Commerce fees. <a href="%s">Activate your license</a> to remove additional fees and unlock powerful features.'=>'<strong>按需付费定价</strong><br>每笔交易收取 3%% 手续费 + PayPal Commerce 费用。<a href="%s">激活您的许可证</a>，以免除额外费用并解锁强大功能。','Try to bill the customer again if the payment fails on the first attempt.'=>'如果首次扣款失败，请尝试再次向客户扣款。','Infinite'=>'无限','Total Cycles'=>'总循环数','Select how often you would like the charge to recur.'=>'请选择您希望该费用以何种频率重复收取。','Recurring Times'=>'重复时间','Select the type of product that this subscription is for.'=>'请选择此订阅对应的产品类型。','Service'=>'服务','Physical'=>'‌实体商品','Digital'=>'数字产品','Product Type'=>'产品类型','Enter a name for the recurring plan. Leave this field blank to use the default name.'=>'输入重复计划的名称。将此字段留空以使用默认名称。','Select the field that contains the buyer\'s name. This setting is optional and only used when Card Holder Name is disabled.'=>'选择包含买家姓名的字段。此设置为可选，仅在“持卡人姓名”功能被禁用时使用。','--- Select a Field ---'=>'--- 选择字段 ---','The PayPal Commerce addon can\'t be activated while PayPal Standard is in use. Please deactivate the PayPal Standard addon and try again.'=>'在使用 PayPal Standard 期间，无法激活 PayPal Commerce 插件。请先停用 PayPal Standard 插件，然后重试。','To use PayPal Commerce, first add the PayPal Commerce field to your form.'=>'要使用 PayPal Commerce，首先需将 PayPal Commerce 字段添加到表单中。','Heads up! An error occurred while disconnecting your PayPal account. Please try again.'=>'请注意！断开您的 PayPal 账户连接时发生错误。请重试。','Learn more about our PayPal Commerce integration.'=>'进一步了解我们的 PayPal Commerce 集成。','Connect WPForms to PayPal Commerce.'=>'将 WPForms 与 PayPal Commerce 连接起来。','Select the field that contains the buyer\'s address. This setting is optional.'=>'选择包含买家地址的字段。此设置为可选。','Select the field that contains the buyer\'s shipping address. This setting is optional.'=>'请选择包含买家收货地址的字段。此设置为可选。','PayPalCommerce Pro'=>'PayPalCommerce Pro','It\'s not possible to process multiple plans at the same time. If your conditional logic matches more than one plan, the form will process the first plan that matches your conditions.'=>'无法同时处理多个方案。如果您的条件逻辑与多个方案匹配，表单将处理第一个符合您条件的方案。','Fastlane, alternative payment methods and credit card fields are not supported for subscriptions and will not display on your form.'=>'Fastlane、其他支付方式和信用卡字段不适用于订阅，因此不会显示在表单上。','Select the field that contains the buyer\'s shipping email. This setting is optional.'=>'选择包含买家收货邮箱的字段。此设置为可选。','Shipping Email'=>'发货邮件','Select the field that contains the buyer\'s shipping name. This setting is optional.'=>'选择包含买家收货人姓名的字段。此设置为可选。','Shipping Name'=>'收货人姓名','Heads up! PayPal Commerce payments can\'t be processed because there\'s a problem with the connection to PayPal. Please visit the <a href=\'%2$s\'>WPForms Settings</a> page to resolve the issue before trying again.'=>'请注意！由于与 PayPal 的连接出现问题，无法处理 PayPal Commerce 支付。请访问 <a href=\'%2$s\'>WPForms 设置</a> 页面解决此问题，然后再试一次。','Connect with PayPal'=>'通过 PayPal 登录','Connect to your PayPal account and start receiving payments today.'=>'立即连接您的 PayPal 账户，今天就开始接收付款吧。','<strong>Payments Cannot Be Processed</strong><br>The currency you have set (%1$s) is not supported by PayPal Commerce. Please choose a different currency, or consider switching your payment gateway to Stripe.'=>'<strong>无法处理付款</strong><br>您设置的货币（%1$s）不受 PayPal Commerce 支持。请选择其他货币，或考虑将支付网关切换为 Stripe。','Heads up! Your connection to PayPal Commerce is not valid. Please reconnect your PayPal Commerce account.'=>'请注意！您与 PayPal Commerce 的连接无效。请重新连接您的 PayPal Commerce 账户。','Heads up! Your connection to PayPal Commerce is not complete. Please reconnect your PayPal Commerce account.'=>'请注意！您与 PayPal Commerce 的连接尚未完成。请重新连接您的 PayPal Commerce 账户。','The PayPalCommerce Pro addon is required to enable conditional logic for payments. Would you like to activate it?'=>'要启用支付的条件逻辑，必须安装 PayPalCommerce Pro 插件。您要激活它吗？','The PayPalCommerce Pro addon is required to enable conditional logic for payments. Would you like to install and activate it?'=>'要启用支付的条件逻辑，必须安装 PayPalCommerce Pro 插件。您要安装并激活它吗？','Notification for PayPal Commerce Completed Payments'=>'关于 PayPal Commerce 已完成支付的通知','The PayPal Commerce Pro addon is required to enable notification for completed payments. Would you like to activate it?'=>'要启用已完成支付的通知功能，必须安装 PayPal Commerce Pro 插件。您要激活它吗？','The PayPal Commerce Pro addon is required to enable notification for completed payments. Would you like to install and activate it?'=>'要启用已完成支付的通知功能，必须安装 PayPal Commerce Pro 插件。您是否要安装并激活该插件？','Enable for PayPalCommerce completed payments'=>'启用 PayPalCommerce 已完成支付功能','Credit Card and Fastlane cannot be enabled at the same time.'=>'信用卡和 Fastlane 不能同时启用。','The recurring plan can’t be changed once you save it. Please create a new plan.'=>'定期计划一旦保存就无法更改。请创建一个新计划。','The product type can’t be changed once you save it. Please create a new plan.'=>'保存后无法更改产品类型。请创建一个新的方案。','The plan name can’t be changed once you save it. Please create a new plan.'=>'计划名称一旦保存就无法更改。请创建一个新计划。','<p>AJAX form submissions are required when using the PayPal Commerce field.</p><p>To proceed, please go to <strong>Settings » General</strong> and check <strong>Enable AJAX form submission</strong>.</p>'=>'<p>使用 PayPal Commerce 字段时，必须启用 AJAX 表单提交功能。</p><p>如需继续，请前往 <strong>设置 » 常规</strong>，并勾选 <strong>启用 AJAX 表单提交</strong>。</p>','Go to page %d'=>'转到第 %d 页','Step %1$s of %2$d'=>'第 %1$s 步，共 %2$d 步','Allow Page Navigation'=>'允许页面导航','Only available when using the Circles or Connector Progress Indicator.'=>'仅在使用“圆圈”或“连接器进度指示器”时可用。','Lets visitors move between pages even if required fields are empty. Required fields are checked when the form is submitted.'=>'允许访客在必填字段为空的情况下仍可在页面间切换。必填字段将在表单提交时进行验证。','Method: %s'=>'方法：%s','When you upgrade to WPForms Pro, we\'ll automatically restore the entries that you collected in WPForms Lite.'=>'当您升级到 WPForms Pro 时，我们会自动恢复您在 WPForms Lite 中收集的表单提交数据。','Free backups save every submission automatically, so when email notifications fail, your data is safe. Restore entries anytime with a Pro upgrade. Entry backups expire after 1 year.'=>'免费备份功能会自动保存每次提交的内容，因此即使电子邮件通知失败，您的数据依然安全无虞。升级至专业版后，您可以随时恢复条目。条目备份将在 1 年后过期。','Accept payments using PayPal Commerce, Stripe, and Square only'=>'仅支持通过 PayPal Commerce、Stripe 和 Square 接收付款','You\'ve enabled Conditional Logic but the rule is incomplete, which could affect form submission. Complete the condition or disable Conditional Logic to continue.'=>'您已启用“条件逻辑”，但规则尚未填写完整，这可能会影响表单提交。请完善条件或禁用“条件逻辑”以继续操作。','Incomplete Condition'=>'未完成状态','The WPForms PayPal Commerce addon is out of date. To avoid payment processing issues, please upgrade the WPForms PayPal Commerce addon to the latest version.'=>'WPForms PayPal Commerce 插件已过时。为避免支付处理问题，请将 WPForms PayPal Commerce 插件升级至最新版本。','They will not be present in the published form. <a href="%1$s" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Upgrade now</a> to unlock these features.'=>'这些内容不会以发布形式呈现。<a href="%1$s" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">立即升级</a>以解锁这些功能。','100 mi'=>'100 英里','50 mi'=>'50 英里','25 mi'=>'25 英里','Hide Full Screen '=>'隐藏全屏 ','Presentational Settings'=>'演示设置','Zoom Level'=>'缩放级别','Allow Location Selection'=>'允许选择位置','Show List of Locations'=>'显示地点列表','Search Radius'=>'搜索半径','Find Nearby Locations'=>'查找附近地点','map'=>'地图','Map'=>'地图','Option Disabled'=>'选项已禁用','25 km'=>'25 km','10 km'=>'10 km','Show Thumbnail in Entry '=>'在条目中显示缩略图 ','Show in Entry '=>'在条目中显示 ','Disable Mouse Zooming '=>'禁用鼠标缩放功能 ','Disable Dragging '=>'禁用拖拽功能 ','Hide Zoom '=>'隐藏缩放 ','Hide Camera Control '=>'隐藏摄像头控制 ','Interactive Settings'=>'交互设置','Hide Street View '=>'隐藏街景 ','Hide Location Info '=>'隐藏位置信息 ','Hide Map Type '=>'隐藏地图类型 ','10 mi'=>'10英里','100 km'=>'100公里','50 km'=>'50公里','Entry statistics require WPForms Pro. Upgrade to access detailed form submission data.'=>'查看提交统计数据需要 WPForms Pro。请升级以访问详细的表单提交数据。','The ID of the form to get stats for.'=>'要获取统计数据的表单的 ID。','Get basic statistics for a WPForms form. Upgrade to Pro for detailed entry data.'=>'获取 WPForms 表单的基本统计数据。升级至 Pro 版可查看详细的提交数据。','Get Form Stats'=>'获取表单统计数据','Your Form Uses the Quiz Addon'=>'您的表单使用了测验插件','Create a weighted quiz on the topic of "How prepared are you to start a business?" with 10 questions and 3 answers each. Collect the user\'s name and email address. Create 3 outcomes set to Weighted Quiz type for greater than 74%, less than 75% and greater than 49%, and less than 50%.'=>'围绕“你创业的准备程度如何？”这一主题，创建一份加权测验，包含10道题目，每道题目有3个选项。收集用户的姓名和电子邮箱地址。创建3个结果集，分别对应“大于74%”、“小于75%”以及“大于49%”、“小于50%”，并将它们设置为“加权测验”类型。','How prepared are you to start a business?'=>'你创业的准备工作做得如何？','Create a personality quiz on the topic of "What is your ideal learning style?" with 10 questions and 4 answers each. The personalities are Visual, Auditory, Reading/Writing, and Kinesthetic. Collect the user\'s name and email address. Create 4 outcomes set to Personality Quiz type with neutral text and utilize the available smart tags.'=>'围绕“你的理想学习风格是什么？”这一主题，创建一份包含10道题目（每道题目有4个选项）的性格测试。性格类型包括视觉型、听觉型、阅读/写作型和动觉型。收集用户的姓名和电子邮箱地址。创建4个结果，将其设置为“性格测试”类型，使用中性文本，并利用现有的智能标签。','What is your ideal learning style?'=>'你的理想学习方式是什么？','Create a graded quiz on the topic of "How well do you know world capitals?" with 10 questions and 3 answers each. Randomize the choices. Collect the user\'s name and email address. Create 4 outcomes set to Graded Quiz type with appropriate text for each grade and utilize the available smart tags. The graded outcomes should be if Quiz Grade is A, if Quiz Grade is B, if Quiz Grade is C, if Quiz Grade is D, and if Quiz Grade is F.'=>'围绕“你对世界各国首都了解多少？”这一主题，创建一份带评分的测验，包含10道题目，每道题目有3个选项。将选项随机排列。收集用户的姓名和电子邮箱地址。创建4个结果集，将其设置为“评分测验”类型，并为每个等级设置相应的文本，同时使用可用的智能标签。评分结果应包括：若测验成绩为A、若测验成绩为B、若测验成绩为C、若测验成绩为D以及若测验成绩为F。','How well do you know world capitals?'=>'你对世界各国首都了解多少？','It looks like you\'re trying to create a quiz. Would you like to activate the <a href="%1$s" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Quiz Addon</a> and easily create graded, personality, and weighted quizzes?'=>'看起来您正在尝试创建一份测验。您是否想启用 <a href="%1$s" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">测验插件</a>，从而轻松创建带评分、性格测试和加权测验？','You do not have permission to view forms.'=>'您没有查看表单的权限。','Whether to include field configuration.'=>'是否包含字段配置。','The ID of the form to retrieve.'=>'要检索的表单的 ID。','Get detailed information about a specific WPForms form including its fields.'=>'获取有关特定 WPForms 表单（包括其字段）的详细信息。','Get Form'=>'获取表单','Total number of forms returned.'=>'返回的表单总数。','Array of form objects.'=>'表单对象数组。','Number of forms to skip.'=>'要跳过的表单数。','Maximum number of forms to return.'=>'要返回的表单的最大数量。','Filter forms by status.'=>'按状态筛选表单。','List all available WPForms forms with their metadata.'=>'列出所有可用的 WPForms 表单及其元数据。','List Forms'=>'列表表单','Abilities for interacting with WPForms forms and entries.'=>'用于与 WPForms 表单和表单条目进行交互的功能。','Include in Quiz Scoring'=>'计入测验评分','We\'re sorry, Enable Quiz is part of the Quiz Addon and not available on your plan. Please upgrade to the PRO plan to unlock all these awesome features.'=>'很抱歉，“启用测验”功能属于“测验”附加组件，您的套餐中未包含此功能。请升级至 PRO 套餐，以解锁所有这些精彩功能。','Redo'=>'重做','Undo'=>'撤消','Paste Fields'=>'粘贴字段','Copy Fields'=>'复制字段','Surveys, Polls, and Quizzes'=>'调查、投票和测验','Create interactive Surveys, Polls, and Quizzes with beautiful reports'=>'创建交互式调查、投票和测验，并生成精美的报告','%1$d fields copied. Use %2$s + V to paste.'=>'已复制 %1$d 个字段。请按 %2$s + V 粘贴。','Field copied. Use %1$s + V to paste.'=>'字段已复制。请使用 %1$s + V 粘贴。','This field can’t be selected alongside Layout or Repeater fields.'=>'此字段不能与布局或重复字段一起选择。','The Layout field can\'t be selected with other fields.'=>'“布局”字段不能与其他字段一起选中。','The Repeater field can\'t be selected with other fields.'=>'“重复”栏不能与其他栏一起选择。','Quiz Detected'=>'检测到测验','You’re all set. We’re going to continue building your form.'=>'一切就绪。接下来我们将继续构建您的表单。','Addon Activated'=>'插件已启用','Addon Installed'=>'插件已安装','Form handler not available.'=>'表单处理程序不可用。','Form not found.'=>'未找到表单。','Invalid form ID.'=>'表单 ID 无效。','You do not have permission to view this form.'=>'您无权查看此表单。','Quiz Addon'=>'测验插件','Easily create interactive quizzes. Add true or false, multiple choice, or checkbox questions. Set correct answers and automatically score submissions. <a href="%1$s" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Learn more about the Quiz Addon</a>'=>'轻松创建互动测验。添加是非题、多项选择题或复选框题。设置正确答案并自动评分。<a href="%1$s" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">了解有关“测验”插件的更多信息</a>','Turn Your Form Into a Quiz'=>'将表单转换为测验','Are you sure you want to duplicate these %s fields?'=>'您确定要复制这些 %s 字段吗？','Delete Fields'=>'删除字段','Are you sure you want to delete these %s fields?'=>'您确定要删除这些 %s 字段吗？','Duplicate Fields'=>'重复字段','Recipe Created'=>'食谱已创建','Create Your First Recipe'=>'创建你的第一道食谱','Activate Uncanny Automator'=>'激活“Uncanny Automator”','Uncanny Automator Installed & Activated'=>'Uncanny Automator 已安装并激活','Install Uncanny Automator'=>'安装 Uncanny Automator','Connect Automator and start building automations that save hours every week.'=>'连接 Automator，开始构建自动化流程，每周为您节省数小时的时间。','Install and Activate Uncanny Automator'=>'安装并激活 Uncanny Automator','Open the Automator menu, click Add New, choose your trigger (e.g. form submission), and define your action (e.g. send email, update CRM).'=>'打开“Automator”菜单，点击“添加新任务”，选择触发器（例如表单提交），并定义操作（例如发送电子邮件、更新 CRM）。','Create Your First Automation (Recipe)'=>'创建您的第一个自动化（配方）','Uncanny Automator Pro Installed & Activated'=>'Uncanny Automator Pro 已安装并激活','Click Save Recipe, run a test, and watch your workflow run on its own, no code needed.'=>'点击“保存配方”，运行测试，然后观看您的工作流自动运行，无需编写代码。','Save and Test Your Automation'=>'保存并测试您的自动化流程','Use the Calendar block or shortcode [sc_events_calendar] to embed events anywhere on your site.'=>'使用“日历”模块或短代码 [sc_events_calendar]，即可将活动嵌入网站的任意位置。','Display Events on Your Site'=>'在您的网站上展示活动','Sugar Calendar screenshot'=>'“Sugar Calendar”截图','Set up recurring events: daily, weekly, monthly, or custom patterns.'=>'设置重复事件：每日、每周、每月或自定义模式。','Visitors can add events to Google, Apple, or Outlook calendars with one click.'=>'访客只需点击一下，即可将活动添加到 Google、Apple 或 Outlook 日历中。','Sell tickets with Stripe or WooCommerce integration.'=>'通过 Stripe 或 WooCommerce 集成销售门票。','Display events on beautiful calendars visitors can browse and filter.'=>'在精美的日历上展示活动，访客可以浏览和筛选这些活动。','Simple, elegant, and built for your workflow.'=>'简洁、优雅，专为您的工作流程而设计。','Together, they turn bookings into events your visitors can browse, sync, and show up for.'=>'借助这些功能，他们将预约转化为活动，让访客可以浏览、同步并参与其中。','WPForms collects the "yes." Sugar Calendar shows the "when and where."'=>'WPForms 收集“是否”的答复。Sugar Calendar 显示“时间和地点”。','WPForms ♥ Sugar Calendar'=>'WPForms ♥ Sugar Calendar','Taking Bookings? Put Them on a Calendar'=>'正在接受预订吗？把它们记在日历上吧','Could not activate the plugin. Please activate it on the <a href="%1$s">Plugins page</a>.'=>'无法激活该插件。请在 <a href="%1$s">“插件”页面</a>上将其激活。','Could not install the plugin automatically. Please <a href="%1$s">download</a> it and install it manually.'=>'无法自动安装该插件。请 <a href="%1$s">下载</a> 该插件并手动安装。','Duplicator Pro Installed & Activated'=>'已安装并激活 Duplicator Pro','Trusted by over 1.5 million websites.'=>'已获得超过150万个网站的信赖。','Every form entry lives in your database. One bad update, one crash, and it\'s gone. Duplicator backs up your entire site automatically so you can restore everything with one click.'=>'每个表单的提交数据都存储在您的数据库中。一旦发生一次错误的更新或一次崩溃，这些数据就会丢失。Duplicator 会自动备份您的整个网站，因此您只需点击一下即可恢复所有内容。','WPForms ♥ Duplicator'=>'WPForms ♥ Duplicator','WPForms Collects It. Duplicator Protects It.'=>'WPForms 负责收集数据，Duplicator 负责保护数据。','Automation'=>'自动化','Backups'=>'备份','Events'=>'事件','Uncanny Automator screenshot'=>'Uncanny Automator 截图','Automate tasks, save time, and keep everything running smoothly. Uncanny Automator connects your favorite tools so your site works smarter. No code. No stress.'=>'实现任务自动化，节省时间，确保一切运行顺畅。Uncanny Automator 将您喜爱的工具连接起来，让您的网站运行得更智能。无需编写代码，轻松无忧。','WPForms ♥ Uncanny Automator'=>'WPForms ♥ Uncanny Automator','Create Your First Backup'=>'创建您的第一个备份','Duplicator Installed & Activated'=>'Duplicator 已安装并激活','Install Duplicator'=>'安装 Duplicator','Activate Duplicator'=>'启用 Duplicator','Your first step toward bulletproof backups.'=>'迈向万无一失的备份的第一步。','Install and Activate Duplicator'=>'安装并激活 Duplicator','Cloud Backups Set Up'=>'云备份设置','Set Up Cloud Backups'=>'设置云备份','Because the data you collect with WPForms is too valuable to lose.'=>'因为通过 WPForms 收集到的数据实在太过宝贵，绝不能丢失。','Keep your data safe forever with automatic daily backups to Google Drive, Dropbox, or Amazon S3.'=>'通过每天自动将数据备份到 Google Drive、Dropbox 或 Amazon S3，让您的数据永久安全无忧。','Set Up Scheduled Cloud Backups'=>'设置定时云备份','Duplicator screenshot'=>'Duplicator 屏幕截图','Let Your Site Handle the Busywork.'=>'让您的网站来处理繁琐的工作。','Event Created'=>'活动已创建','Add First Event'=>'添加第一个事件','Add your first booking or class to your calendar in seconds. Clean, simple, and built right into WordPress.'=>'只需几秒钟，即可将您的首次预约或课程添加到日历中。界面简洁、操作简单，并直接集成在 WordPress 中。','Create Your First Event'=>'创建您的首个活动','Activate Sugar Calendar'=>'启动 Sugar Calendar','Sugar Calendar Installed & Activated'=>'已安装并激活 Sugar Calendar','Install Sugar Calendar'=>'安装 Sugar Calendar','Bring your forms to life. Install Sugar Calendar and start creating events.'=>'让您的表单焕发活力。安装 Sugar Calendar，开始创建活动吧。','Install and Activate Sugar Calendar'=>'安装并激活 Sugar Calendar','Sugar Calendar Pro Installed & Activated'=>'已安装并激活 Sugar Calendar Pro','From the same team trusted by over 6 million sites.'=>'由深受600多万个网站信赖的团队打造。','Backup Created'=>'备份已创建','Create First Backup'=>'创建首次备份','Back up your site — forms, entries, settings, everything — in just one click.'=>'只需点击一下，即可备份您的网站——表单、条目、设置，所有内容。','In order to complete your form\'s Stripe One-Time Payments and Recurring Subscription Payments, please check that all required (*) fields have been filled out.'=>'为了完成您表单中的 Stripe 单次支付和定期订阅支付，请确认所有必填（*）字段均已填写。','In order to complete your form\'s Stripe Recurring Subscription Payments, please check that all required (*) fields have been filled out.'=>'为了完成您表单中的 Stripe 定期订阅付款，请确认所有必填（*）字段均已填写。','In order to complete your form\'s Stripe One-Time Payments, please check that all required (*) fields have been filled out.'=>'为了完成表单中的 Stripe 单次支付，请确认所有必填（*）字段均已填写。','Enable this option to hide the images in notifications.'=>'启用此选项可隐藏通知中的图片。','Enable this option to hide the images in entries and notifications.'=>'启用此选项可隐藏条目和通知中的图片。','Hide Images in Notifications'=>'在通知中隐藏图片','Hide Images in Entries'=>'在条目中隐藏图片','Enable this option to use images with choices'=>'启用此选项可使用带选项的图片','Select the size of the Other input.'=>'请选择“其他”输入项的大小。','Enter placeholder text for the Other input.'=>'请在“其他”输入框中输入占位文本。','Add an Other choice so users can input their own value.'=>'添加一个“其他”选项，以便用户可以输入自定义值。','Add Other Choice'=>'添加其他选项','This email was auto-generated and sent from %1$s. <br> If you want to disable these weekly emails, click <a href="%2$s">here</a>, or read the guide <a href="%3$s">here</a>.'=>'此电子邮件由 %1$s 自动生成并发送。<br> 如果您想取消订阅这些每周邮件，请点击<a href="%2$s">此处</a>，或阅读<a href="%3$s">此处的指南</a>。','If you want to disable these weekly emails, open %1$s, or read the guide %2$s.'=>'如果您想停用这些每周邮件，请打开 %1$s，或阅读指南 %2$s。','Logged-in User\'s Email'=>'已登录用户的电子邮件地址','<a href="%s" class="wpforms-btn wpforms-btn-md wpforms-btn-light-grey">Disconnect</a>'=>'<a href="%s" class="wpforms-btn wpforms-btn-md wpforms-btn-light-grey">断开连接</a>','How many times you want the payment to repeat. Stripe supports up to 100 recurrences or a maximum duration of 20 years, whichever comes first.'=>'您希望该付款重复多少次。Stripe 支持最多 100 次重复付款，或最长 20 年的期限，以先到者为准。','Recurring Cycles'=>'循环周期','Unlimited'=>'无限','Read-Only'=>'只读','Check this option to show the field’s value without allowing changes. It will still be submitted.'=>'选中此选项可显示该字段的值，但不允许进行修改。该字段的值仍会被提交。','Minutes'=>'分钟','Set the time limit for camera recording.'=>'设置相机录制的时间限制。','Time Limit'=>'时间限制','Ratio Height'=>'比例高度','Ratio Width'=>'比例宽度','2:3'=>'2:3','4:5'=>'4:5','9:16'=>'9:16','Portrait orientation'=>'纵向','3:2'=>'3:2','5:4'=>'5:4','16:9'=>'16:9','Landscape orientation'=>'横向布局','Freeform'=>'自由形式','Original'=>'原始','Drag & Drop File, %1$sChoose File to Upload%2$s, or %3$sCapture With Camera%2$s'=>'拖放文件，%1$s选择要上传的文件%2$s，或 %3$s使用相机拍摄%2$s','Drag & Drop Files or %1$sChoose Files to Upload%2$s'=>'拖放文件或 %1$s 选择要上传的文件 %2$s','Drag & Drop File or %1$sChoose File to Upload%2$s'=>'拖放文件或 %1$s 选择要上传的文件 %2$s','Link'=>'链接','Button'=>'按钮','Choose the style of the camera button.'=>'选择相机按钮的样式。','Capture With Your Camera'=>'用相机拍摄','Missing Link Text'=>'缺失的链接文本','Camera field with Link style cannot have empty Link Text. Please enter text or change style to Button.'=>'采用“链接”样式的表单字段不能留空“链接文本”。请输入文本或将样式更改为“按钮”。','Enter the text for the link.'=>'输入链接的文本。','Enter the text for the button link.'=>'请输入按钮链接的文本。','Link Text'=>'链接文本','Button Link Text'=>'按钮链接文本','photo, image, capture, webcam'=>'照片、图片、截图、网络摄像头','Camera'=>'相机','Photo'=>'照片','Select the camera format.'=>'选择相机格式。','Check this option to enable the camera field.'=>'选中此选项以启用摄像头字段。','Enable Camera'=>'启用摄像头','Below'=>'下面','Select the position of the label'=>'选择标签的位置','Label Position'=>'标签位置','This label indicates the highest score on the scale.'=>'该标签表示该量表上的最高分。','This label indicates the lowest score on the scale.'=>'该标签表示该量表上的最低分。','Check this option to add a toggle for showing and hiding the password.'=>'选中此选项可添加一个用于显示和隐藏密码的切换按钮。','Enable Password Visibility'=>'启用密码显示功能','Drag & Drop Files, %1$sChoose Files to Upload%2$s, or %3$sCapture With Camera%2$s'=>'拖放文件，%1$s选择要上传的文件%2$s，或 %3$s使用相机拍摄%2$s','Sorry, your user role doesn\'t have permission to access this feature.'=>'抱歉，您的用户角色无权使用此功能。','Insufficient Permissions'=>'权限不足','Add query string parameters to append to the URL when the form is submitted. Separate multiple parameters with an ampersand (&).'=>'添加查询字符串参数，以便在表单提交时将其附加到 URL 后。多个参数之间用“&”分隔。','Please use the default <a href="%s">WordPress Media</a> interface to remove this file.'=>'请使用默认的 <a href="%s">WordPress 媒体</a> 界面来删除此文件。','Seconds'=>'秒','Select the camera aspect ratio.'=>'选择相机的宽高比。','Aspect Ratio'=>'宽高比','Video'=>'视频','URL Parameters'=>'URL 参数','Prevent email suggestions for common typos. Enable this if you find the suggestions distracting.'=>'防止常见错别字的邮件建议。如果你觉得这些建议让人分心，请启用此选项。','Disable Suggestions'=>'禁用建议','Back to Previous Page (Referrer) '=>'返回上一页（来源页） ','Set Up WPConsent'=>'设置 WPConsent','Self-hosted. Your data remains on your site.'=>'自主托管。您的数据仍保存在您的网站上。','Tools like Google Analytics and Facebook Pixel paused until consent.'=>'Google Analytics 和 Facebook Pixel 等工具将在获得同意前暂停使用。','A professional banner that fits your site.'=>'一款适合您网站的专业横幅。','WPConsent screenshot'=>'WPConsent 截图','Built for transparency. Designed for ease.'=>'致力于透明化。设计简便易用。','Build trust with clear, compliant privacy practices. WPConsent adds clean, professional banners and handles the technical side for you.'=>'通过清晰且符合规定的隐私保护措施建立信任。WPConsent 为您添加简洁专业的横幅，并为您处理技术方面的事宜。','Make Your Website Privacy-Compliant in Minutes'=>'几分钟内让您的网站符合隐私保护规定','WPForms ♥ WPConsent'=>'WPForms ♥ WPConsent','WPConsent Pro Installed & Activated'=>'已安装并激活 WPConsent Pro','WPConsent Installed & Activated'=>'已安装并激活 WPConsent','WPForms PDF Addon'=>'WPForms PDF 插件','Try it Out'=>'试一试','Easily turn form entry data into beautifully designed PDFs and attach them to notifications.'=>'轻松将表单填写数据转换为设计精美的PDF文件，并将其作为附件添加到通知中。','Maximum Value'=>'最大值','Please enter a value greater than or equal to %s.'=>'请输入一个大于或等于 %s 的数值。','Minimum Value'=>'最小值','Privacy Compliance'=>'隐私合规','Activate WPConsent'=>'激活 WPConsent','WPConsent'=>'WPConsent','Install WPConsent'=>'安装 WPConsent','Install WPConsent from the WordPress.org plugin repository.'=>'从 WordPress.org 插件库安装 WPConsent。','Install & Activate WPConsent'=>'安装并激活 WPConsent','With WPConsent Pro you can access advanced features like geolocation, popup layout, records of consent, multilanguage support, and more.'=>'借助 WPConsent Pro，您可以使用地理定位、弹出窗口布局、同意记录、多语言支持等高级功能。','Get Advanced Cookie Consent Features'=>'获取高级 Cookie 同意功能','WPConsent has an intuitive setup wizard to guide you through the cookie consent configuration process.'=>'WPConsent 提供了一个直观的设置向导，可引导您完成 Cookie 同意配置流程。','Peace of mind knowing you’re aligned with global laws.'=>'确信自己遵守了全球法律法规，让您高枕无忧。','PDF Addon'=>'PDF 插件','Please enter a value less than or equal to %s.'=>'请输入一个小于或等于 %s 的数值。','Remove the selected image'=>'删除所选图片','Upload an image'=>'上传图片','No image selected'=>'未选择图片','Preview of selected image'=>'所选图片的预览','<h4>Want to customize your form styles without editing CSS?</h4> <p>%1$s</p> <a href="%2$s" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Go to Settings</a>'=>'<h4>想在不编辑 CSS 的情况下自定义表单样式吗？</h4> <p>%1$s</p> <a href="%2$s" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">前往“设置”</a>','Awesome new features are waiting for you!'=>'精彩的新功能正等着您！','Update WPForms'=>'更新 WPForms','The security token has expired. Please resubmit the form.'=>'安全令牌已过期。请重新提交表单。','Please enter a value less than or equal to {0}.'=>'请输入一个小于或等于 {0} 的数值。','Please enter a value greater than or equal to {0}.'=>'请输入一个大于或等于 {0} 的数值。','Enter text to show the user\'s progress. You can use {current_page} and {last_page} to indicate the current and last steps.'=>'输入文本以显示用户的进度。您可以使用 {current_page} 和 {last_page} 来表示当前步骤和上一步。','Enter text for the progress indicator.'=>'请输入进度条的文本。','Progress Text'=>'进度文本','Do not show the horizontal divider line.'=>'不要显示水平分隔线。','Hide Divider Line'=>'隐藏分隔线','We\'ve added some great new features to help grow your business and generate more leads. Here are the highlights...'=>'我们新增了一些很棒的功能，旨在帮助您拓展业务并吸引更多潜在客户。以下是主要亮点……','Color'=>'颜色','Sublabel'=>'子标签','Theme'=>'主题','<h4>Update Available</h4> <p>%1$s</p> <a href="%2$s" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Update Now</a>'=>'<h4>有更新</h4> <p>%1$s</p> <a href="%2$s" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">立即更新</a>','Your version of Form Pages is out of date. For the best experience and access to all features, please update to the latest version.'=>'您当前使用的“表单页面”版本已过时。为获得最佳体验并使用所有功能，请更新至最新版本。','Back to Settings'=>'返回“设置”','The fields shown below are for demo purposes and do not reflect the fields in your actual form.'=>'下面显示的字段仅用于演示目的，并不代表您实际表单中的字段。','Preview only'=>'仅供预览','<h4>Form styles are disabled because Conversational Forms addon is turned on.</h4> <p>To change the styling for this form, edit the options in the <a href="#">Conversational Forms settings.</a></p>'=>'<h4>由于已启用“对话式表单”插件，因此表单样式已被禁用。</h4> <p>若要更改此表单的样式，请在 <a href="#">“对话式表单”设置中编辑相关选项。</a></p>','<h4>Form styles are disabled because Lead Form Mode is turned on.</h4> <p>To change the styling for this form, edit the options in the <a href="#">Lead Forms settings.</a></p>'=>'<h4>由于已启用“潜在客户表单模式”，因此表单样式已被禁用。</h4> <p>若要更改此表单的样式，请在 <a href="#">“潜在客户表单”设置中编辑相关选项。</a></p>','What’s New'=>'最新动态','Support Forum'=>'支持论坛','Videos'=>'视频','If the issue persists, <a href="%s" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">please contact support</a>.'=>'如果问题仍然存在，<a href="%s" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">请联系客服</a>。','A critical error has occurred, preventing your form from loading. This issue may arise from incorrect code in a third-party theme or plugin, or from invalid characters in your form. You can attempt to restore a previous version of your form using <a href="#" class="wpforms-panel-content-revisions-link">Form Revisions</a>.'=>'发生了一个严重错误，导致表单无法加载。此问题可能是由于第三方主题或插件中的代码有误，或者表单中包含无效字符所致。您可以尝试使用 <a href="#" class="wpforms-panel-content-revisions-link">表单修订版本</a> 恢复表单的先前版本。','Corrupted Form Data'=>'损坏的表单数据','The form cannot be saved due to a <a href="%1$s" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">403 error</a>.'=>'由于出现 <a href="%1$s" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">403 错误</a>，无法保存该表单。','Please contact support if this behavior persists.'=>'如果该问题仍然存在，请联系客服。','Are you sure you want to disconnect this account? Any form connections you have set up will be lost.'=>'您确定要断开此账户的连接吗？您已设置的所有表单连接都将丢失。','Robust Failsafes'=>'可靠的故障安全措施','Enhanced Data Management'=>'增强型数据管理','Automated Deletions'=>'自动删除','Task Chaining'=>'任务链','Scheduled Exports'=>'定时导出','Automated Task Scheduling'=>'自动化任务调度','Upgrade to WPForms Elite'=>'升级至 WPForms Elite','Entry Automation'=>'条目自动化','Powerful Automation Features'=>'强大的自动化功能','Entry Automation introduces powerful, automated task chaining, allowing you to seamlessly schedule exports and deletions, ensuring your data is managed precisely how you need it. Chain multiple tasks together for complex workflows – export to CSV, then automatically delete after a specified period, for example. We\'ve built robust failsafes to guarantee data integrity, so you can automate with confidence, knowing your valuable entries are always protected. Take back your time and let our addon handle the heavy lifting, keeping your WPForms data organized and secure, automatically.'=>'Entry Automation 引入了强大的自动化任务链功能，让您能够无缝安排导出和删除操作，确保数据管理完全符合您的需求。您可以将多个任务串联起来以实现复杂的工作流——例如，先导出为 CSV 文件，然后在指定时间后自动删除。我们构建了强大的故障防护机制来保障数据完整性，因此您可以放心进行自动化操作，确信您的宝贵条目始终受到保护。腾出您的时间，让我们的插件来处理繁重的工作，自动保持您的 WPForms 数据井井有条且安全无虞。','Tired of manually exporting and deleting entries? Wish you could schedule these actions for optimal efficiency?'=>'厌倦了手动导出和删除条目了吗？希望能够安排这些操作以实现最高效率吗？','--- Select Meta Value ---'=>'--- 选择元数据值 ---','Customer'=>'客户','--- Select Object Type ---'=>'--- 选择对象类型 ---','Meta Value'=>'元数据值','Meta Key'=>'Meta Key','Object Type'=>'对象类型','Map custom meta to form field values.'=>'将自定义元数据映射到表单字段值。','%1$s for additional information on PHP version.'=>'有关 PHP 版本的更多信息，请参阅 %1$s。','Select the field that contains the customer\'s phone. This is optional but recommended.'=>'选择包含客户电话号码的字段。此步骤虽非必需，但建议执行。','Customer Phone'=>'客户电话','--- Select Phone ---'=>'--- 选择手机 ---','Height (px)'=>'高度（像素）','Width (px)'=>'宽度（像素）','Padding (px)'=>'内边距（像素）','Border Size (px)'=>'边框大小（像素）','DELETE THEME'=>'删除主题','<b>Want to customize your form styles without editing CSS?</b> <p>%1$s</p> <a href="%2$s" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Learn more</a>'=>'<b>想在不编辑 CSS 的情况下自定义表单样式吗？</b> <p>%1$s</p> <a href="%2$s" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">了解更多</a>','Update your forms to use base and form theme styling and unlock extensive style controls.'=>'更新您的表单，以使用基础样式和表单主题样式，从而解锁丰富的样式控制功能。','Upgrade your forms to use our modern markup and unlock extensive style controls.'=>'升级您的表单，以使用我们的现代标记语言，并解锁丰富的样式控制功能。','Enter License Key'=>'输入许可证密钥','Entry Storage Required'=>'需输入存储信息','Some third-party integrations require entry storage. If you’d like to continue, you’ll first need to disable %s.'=>'某些第三方集成需要使用输入存储功能。如果您想继续，首先需要禁用 %s。','Custom Meta'=>'自定义元数据','Read more'=>'阅读更多','%1$s for additional information on PHP extensions.'=>'有关 PHP 扩展的更多信息，请参阅 %1$s。','To access the %name%, please enter and activate your WPForms license key in the plugin settings.'=>'要访问 %name%，请在插件设置中输入并激活您的 WPForms 许可证密钥。','Error loading themes. Please try again later.'=>'加载主题时出错。请稍后再试。','%s connection'=>'%s 连接','Repeat Y'=>'纵向重复','Repeat X'=>'横向重复','Field value %1$s'=>'字段值 %1$s','Field %1$s'=>'字段 %1$s','Unknown Field'=>'未知字段','argument'=>'实参','edit'=>'编辑','Delete smart tag'=>'删除智能标签','Apply changes'=>'应用更改','Something went wrong, and we can’t connect to the provider. Please check your <a href="%s" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">connection settings</a>.'=>'出现了一些问题，我们无法连接到该服务提供商。请检查您的 <a href="%s" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">连接设置</a>。','Notification for Stripe Completed Payments'=>'关于 Stripe 已完成支付的通知','The Stripe Pro addon is required to enable notification for completed payments. Would you like to activate it?'=>'要启用支付完成通知，需要安装 Stripe Pro 插件。您要激活它吗？','The Stripe Pro addon is required to enable notification for completed payments. Would you like to install and activate it?'=>'要启用支付完成通知，需要安装 Stripe Pro 插件。您要安装并启用它吗？','Enable for Stripe completed payments'=>'启用 Stripe 已完成支付功能','When recurring subscription payments are enabled, the Customer Email is required.'=>'启用定期订阅付款功能时，必须填写客户邮箱。','Looks like you have a problem with your webhooks configuration. Please check and confirm that you\'ve configured the WPForms webhooks in your Square account. This notice will disappear automatically when a new Square request comes in. See our <a href="%1$s" rel="nofollow noopener" target="_blank">documentation</a> for more information.'=>'看来您的 Webhooks 配置存在问题。请检查并确认您已在 Square 账户中配置了 WPForms Webhooks。当收到新的 Square 请求时，此提示将自动消失。如需了解更多信息，请参阅我们的 <a href="%1$s" rel="nofollow noopener" target="_blank">文档</a>。','An unexpected Square SDK error has occurred.'=>'发生了意外的 Square SDK 错误。','Square.js failed to load properly.'=>'Square.js 未能正确加载。','CVV'=>'CVV','MM/YY'=>'MM/YY','Heads up! Square account connection is expired. Tokens must be refreshed.'=>'请注意！Square 账户的连接已过期。必须刷新令牌。','Credit Card field is disabled, Square payments are not enabled in the form settings.'=>'“信用卡”字段已被禁用，表单设置中未启用 Square 支付功能。','Credit Card field is disabled, Square account connection is invalid. Please, contact to the site administrator.'=>'信用卡字段已禁用，Square 账户连接无效。请联系网站管理员。','Credit Card field is disabled, Square account connection is missing.'=>'“信用卡”字段已禁用，未连接 Square 账户。','The WPForms Square payments require cURL to be enabled to work correctly.'=>'WPForms 的 Square 支付功能需要启用 cURL 才能正常工作。','Failed to create webhook.'=>'无法创建 Webhook。','Webhook created successfully!'=>'Webhook 已成功创建！','Personal access token is required.'=>'需要个人访问令牌。','Payment for transaction %s was not updated.'=>'交易 %s 的付款状态未更新。','It seems to be request to Square PHP Listener method handler but the site is not configured to use it.'=>'这似乎是向 Square PHP Listener 方法处理程序发出的请求，但该网站未配置使用该功能。','Square fail: something went wrong during subscription update.'=>'Square 错误：订阅更新过程中出现问题。','Missing location ID.'=>'缺少位置 ID。','Square payment stopped, missing card tokens.'=>'Square支付已停止，缺少卡片令牌。','The currency associated with the payment is not valid for the provided business location.'=>'该笔付款所使用的货币在您提供的营业地点无效。','Square account connection is invalid.'=>'Square 账户连接无效。','Square account connection is missing.'=>'缺少 Square 账户连接。','To start using webhooks, please register a webhook route inside our application. You can do this by pressing the button above or setting the credentials manually. Please see <a href="%1$s" target="_blank">our documentation on Square webhooks</a> for full details.'=>'要开始使用 Webhooks，请在我们的应用程序中注册一个 Webhook 路由。您可以通过点击上方的按钮或手动设置凭据来完成此操作。有关详细信息，请参阅 <a href="%1$s" target="_blank">Square Webhooks 文档</a>。','Please go to the <a href="#" class="wpforms-stripe-settings-redirect">Stripe payment settings</a> and fill out the required field(s).'=>'请前往 <a href="#" class="wpforms-stripe-settings-redirect">Stripe 支付设置</a>，并填写必填字段。','<a href="%s" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Upgrade to Pro!</a>'=>'<a href="%s" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">升级到专业版！</a>','Unlock conditional logic, coupons, lower Stripe and PayPal fees, and more.'=>'解锁条件逻辑、优惠券、降低 Stripe 和 PayPal 手续费等功能。','Easily add dynamic information from various sources with <a href="%1$s" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Smart Tags</a>.'=>'使用 <a href="%1$s" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">智能标签</a>，可轻松添加来自各种来源的动态信息。','Entry Date: %1$s'=>'录入日期：%1$s','Date: %1$s'=>'日期：%1$s','User Meta: %1$s'=>'用户元数据：%1$s','Query String Variable: %1$s'=>'查询字符串变量：%1$s','Field HTML %1$s'=>'字段 HTML %1$s','Square payment stopped'=>'Square 支付已停止','Square subscription payment stopped'=>'Square订阅付款已停止','Form #%d'=>'表单编号 #%d','Square subscription payment stopped, customer name not found.'=>'Square 订阅付款已停止，未找到客户姓名。','Square subscription payment stopped, customer email not found.'=>'Square 订阅付款已停止，未找到客户邮箱。','Missing customer email.'=>'缺少客户电子邮件。','Missing customer name.'=>'缺少客户姓名。','Missing subscription cadence.'=>'缺少订阅频率。','Missing subscription plan variation name.'=>'缺少订阅方案变体名称。','Missing subscription plan name.'=>'缺少订阅套餐名称。','Square fail: payment was not processed.'=>'Square 支付失败：支付未成功。','Square fail: order was not created.'=>'Square 操作失败：未创建订单。','Missing order/payment items.'=>'缺失的订单/付款项目。','Missing amount.'=>'缺失金额。','Missing currency.'=>'缺少货币。','Square subscription payment stopped, missing form settings.'=>'Square 订阅付款已停止，缺少表单设置。','Square Subscription payment stopped, validation error.'=>'Square 订阅付款已停止，验证错误。','Square payment stopped, missing payment fields.'=>'Square 支付已停止，缺少支付字段。','Square payment stopped, amount is smaller than the allowed minimum amount for a payment.'=>'Square 支付被中止，金额低于允许的最低支付金额。','Square payment stopped, account connection is missing.'=>'Square 支付已停止，账户未关联。','The verification was not successful. An issue occurred while verifying the buyer.'=>'验证未成功。在验证买家身份时出现问题。','Tokenization failed with status:'=>'令牌化失败，状态为：','Tokenization of the payment card failed.'=>'支付卡令牌化失败。','Initializing Card failed.'=>'初始化卡片失败。','Client ID and/or Location ID is incorrect.'=>'客户端 ID 和/或位置 ID 不正确。','Square fail: something went wrong during subscription process.'=>'Square 错误：订阅过程中出现问题。','Square fail: subscription plan variation was not created.'=>'Square 错误：未创建订阅计划变体。','Square fail: subscription plan was not created.'=>'Square 错误：订阅计划未创建。','Square fail: customer card was not created.'=>'Square 操作失败：未创建客户卡。','Square fail: customer was not created.'=>'Square 错误：未创建客户。','Connect Webhooks'=>'连接 Webhook','Press here to see the further instructions.'=>'点击此处查看更多说明。','Webhooks are connected and active.'=>'Webhooks 已连接且处于活动状态。','Retrieve your %1$s from your <a href="%2$s" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Square webhook settings</a>. Select the endpoint, then click Reveal.'=>'从您的 <a href="%2$s" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Square Webhook 设置</a> 中获取您的 %1$s。选择端点，然后点击“显示”。','Test Mode Signature Key'=>'测试模式签名密钥','Live Mode Signature Key'=>'实时模式签名密钥','Retrieve your %1$s from your <a href="%2$s" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Square webhook settings</a>. Select the endpoint, then click Copy button.'=>'从您的 <a href="%2$s" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Square Webhook 设置</a> 中获取您的 %1$s。选择端点，然后点击“复制”按钮。','Test Mode Endpoint Subscription ID'=>'测试模式端点订阅 ID','Live Mode Endpoint Subscription ID'=>'实时模式端点订阅 ID','Make sure that Webhooks Endpoint is updated inside the Square app after Webhooks Method switch.'=>'在切换 Webhooks 方法后，请确保在 Square 应用中更新 Webhooks 端点。','Webhooks Live Signature Key'=>'Webhooks 实时签名密钥','Webhooks Test Signature Key'=>'Webhooks 测试签名密钥','Ensure an endpoint with the above URL is present in the <a href="%s" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Square webhook settings</a>.'=>'请确保在 <a href="%s" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Square Webhook 设置</a> 中存在一个指向上述 URL 的端点。','Choose the method of communication between Square and WPForms. If REST API support is disabled for WordPress, use PHP listener. <a href="%s" rel="nofollow noopener" target="_blank">Learn more</a>.'=>'选择 Square 与 WPForms 之间的通信方式。如果 WordPress 禁用了 REST API 支持，请使用 PHP 监听器。<a href="%s" rel="nofollow noopener" target="_blank">了解更多</a>。','Prevent Square from processing live transactions. <a href="%s" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="wpforms-learn-more">Learn More</a>'=>'阻止 Square 处理实时交易。<a href="%s" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="wpforms-learn-more">了解更多</a>','Only active locations that support credit card processing in Square can be chosen.'=>'只能选择在 Square 中支持信用卡支付的活跃商户。','Business Location'=>'营业地点','Personal Access Token is required to proceed.'=>'继续操作需要个人访问令牌。','<p>To receive events, create a webhook route by providing your Personal Access Token, which you can find after registering an app on the <a href="%1$s" target="_blank">Square Developer Dashboard</a>. You can also set it up manually in the Advanced section.</p><p>See <a href="%2$s" target="_blank">our documentation</a> for details.</p>'=>'<p>要接收事件，请通过提供您的个人访问令牌来创建一个 Webhook 路由，您可以在 <a href="%1$s" target="_blank">Square 开发者控制台</a> 上注册应用后找到该令牌。您也可以在“高级”部分中手动进行设置。</p><p>详情请参阅 <a href="%2$s" target="_blank">我们的文档</a>。</p>','Personal Access Token'=>'个人访问令牌','Something went wrong while performing a refresh tokens request.'=>'在执行刷新令牌请求时出现错误。','<p>Switching sandbox/production modes requires Square account reconnection.</p><p>Press the <em>"Connect with Square"</em> button after saving the settings to reconnect.</p>'=>'<p>切换沙盒/生产环境模式需要重新连接 Square 账户。</p><p>保存设置后，请点击 <em>“通过 Square 连接”</em> 按钮以重新连接。</p>','<strong>Pay-as-you-go Pricing</strong><br> 3%% fee per-transaction + Square fees. <a href="%s" target="_blank">Upgrade to Pro</a> to remove additional fees and unlock powerful features.'=>'<strong>按需付费定价</strong><br> 每笔交易收取 3%% 手续费 + Square 手续费。<a href="%s" target="_blank">升级至 Pro</a> 以免除额外费用并解锁强大功能。','<strong>Pay-as-you-go Pricing</strong><br> 3%% fee per-transaction + Square fees. <a href="%s">Renew your license</a> to remove additional fees and unlock powerful features.'=>'<strong>按需付费定价</strong><br> 每笔交易收取 3%% 手续费 + Square 手续费。<a href="%s">续订许可证</a>，以免除额外费用并解锁强大功能。','<strong>Pay-as-you-go Pricing</strong><br>3%% fee per-transaction + Square fees. <a href="%s">Activate your license</a> to remove additional fees and unlock powerful features.'=>'<strong>按需付费定价</strong><br>每笔交易收取3%%的手续费 + Square手续费。<a href="%s">激活您的许可证</a>，以免除额外费用并解锁强大功能。','Webhooks are enabled, but not yet connected.'=>'Webhooks 已启用，但尚未连接。','The currency you have set (%1$s) does not match the currency of your Square business location (%2$s). Please choose a different business location or update your WPForms currency to %2$s.'=>'您设置的货币（%1$s）与您的 Square 营业地点（%2$s）的货币不一致。请选择另一个营业地点，或将 WPForms 中的货币更新为 %2$s。','Business Location is required to process Square payments.'=>'处理 Square 支付时，必须提供营业地址。','Square account connection is expired. Tokens must be refreshed.'=>'Square 账户的连接已过期。必须刷新令牌。','Square account connection is invalid. You must reconnect your Square account.'=>'Square 账户连接无效。您必须重新连接您的 Square 账户。','Square account connection is missing required data. You must reconnect your Square account.'=>'Square 账户连接缺少必填数据。您必须重新连接您的 Square 账户。','There Are Some Problems With Your Square Connection'=>'您的 Square 连接存在一些问题','Square Error: We could not save an account connection safely. Please, try again later.'=>'Square 错误：我们无法安全地保存账户连接。请稍后再试。','Square Error: We could not connect to Square. No tokens were given.'=>'Square 错误：无法连接到 Square。未提供任何令牌。','Something went wrong while performing a refresh tokens request'=>'在执行刷新令牌请求时出现错误','You are not allowed to perform this action'=>'您无权执行此操作','Learn more about our Square integration.'=>'了解有关我们与 Square 集成的更多信息。','Connect WPForms to Square.'=>'将 WPForms 与 Square 连接起来。','To use Square, first add the Square payment field to your form.'=>'要使用 Square，首先需将 Square 支付字段添加到表单中。','Tokens must be refreshed. Please refresh them on the <a href=\'%2$s\'>WPForms Settings</a> page.'=>'必须刷新令牌。请在 <a href=\'%2$s\'>WPForms 设置</a> 页面上刷新它们。','Heads up! Square account connection is expired.'=>'注意！Square账户的连接已过期。','Production'=>'生产','Sandbox'=>'沙盒','First, please resolve the connection issue on the <a href=\'%2$s\'>Payment Settings</a> page.'=>'首先，请解决<a href=\'%2$s\'>支付设置</a>页面上的连接问题。','Enter your payment description. Eg: Donation for the soccer team.'=>'请输入付款备注。例如：给足球队的捐款。','The Square Pro addon is required to enable conditional logic for payments. Would you like to activate it?'=>'要启用支付的条件逻辑，必须安装 Square Pro 插件。您要激活它吗？','The Square Pro addon is required to enable conditional logic for payments. Would you like to install and activate it?'=>'要启用支付的条件逻辑，必须安装 Square Pro 插件。您要安装并激活它吗？','Notification for Square Completed Payments'=>'Square 已完成付款通知','The Square Pro addon is required to enable notification for completed payments. Would you like to activate it?'=>'需要安装 Square Pro 插件才能启用支付完成通知。您要激活它吗？','The Square Pro addon is required to enable notification for completed payments. Would you like to install and activate it?'=>'需要安装 Square Pro 插件才能启用支付完成通知。您要安装并激活该插件吗？','Enable for Square completed payments'=>'启用 Square 已完成支付功能','Please go to the <a href="#" class="wpforms-square-settings-redirect">Square payment settings</a> and select a Customer Email and Customer Name.'=>'请前往 <a href="#" class="wpforms-square-settings-redirect">Square 支付设置</a>，并选择“客户邮箱”和“客户姓名”。','When recurring subscription payments are enabled, the Customer Email and Customer Name are required.'=>'启用定期订阅付款功能时，必须填写“客户邮箱”和“客户姓名”。','Missing Required Fields'=>'缺少必填字段','<p>AJAX form submissions are required when using the Square field.</p><p>To proceed, please go to <strong>Settings » General » Advanced</strong> and check <strong>Enable AJAX form submission</strong>.</p>'=>'<p>使用“Square”字段时，必须启用 AJAX 表单提交功能。</p><p>如需继续，请前往 <strong>“设置” » “常规” » “高级”</strong>，并勾选 <strong>“启用 AJAX 表单提交”</strong>。</p>','Square uses webhooks to notify WPForms when an event has occurred in your Square account. Please see <a href="%s" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">our documentation on Square webhooks</a> for full details.'=>'当您的 Square 账户中发生某项事件时，Square 会通过 webhook 通知 WPForms。有关详细信息，请参阅 <a href="%s" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">我们关于 Square webhook 的文档</a>。','No locations were found'=>'未找到任何位置','Refresh tokens'=>'刷新令牌','Refresh connection tokens'=>'刷新连接令牌','Disconnect Square account'=>'注销 Square 账户','Connect with Square'=>'与 Square 建立连接','Connect Square account'=>'连接 Square 账户','WPForms currency and Business Location currency are not matched.'=>'WPForms 中的货币与“企业所在地”中的货币不匹配。','Your connection is expired. You must refresh tokens or reconnect your account.'=>'您的连接已过期。您必须刷新令牌或重新连接您的账户。','It appears your connection may be invalid. You must refresh tokens or reconnect your account.'=>'您的连接似乎无效。您必须刷新令牌或重新连接您的账户。','Your connection is missing required data. You must reconnect your Square account.'=>'您的连接缺少必要数据。您必须重新连接您的 Square 账户。','Securely connect to Square with just a few clicks to begin accepting payments! <a href="%s" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="wpforms-learn-more">Learn More</a>'=>'只需点击几下，即可安全连接到 Square，开始接受付款！<a href="%s" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="wpforms-learn-more">了解更多</a>','Connected to Square as <em>%1$s</em> in <strong>%2$s</strong> mode.'=>'已通过 <strong>%2$s</strong> 模式，以 <em>%1$s</em> 的身份连接到 Square。','Billing Name'=>'账单名称','Select the field that contains the buyer\'s email address. This field is optional.'=>'请选择包含买家电子邮件地址的字段。该字段为可选字段。','--- Select Buyer Email ---'=>'--- 选择买家邮箱 ---','Buyer Email'=>'买家邮箱','Connected to Square in <strong>%s</strong> mode.'=>'已通过 <strong>%s</strong> 模式连接到 Square。','Easily collect credit card payments with Square. For getting started and more information, see our <a href="%s" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Square documentation</a>.'=>'使用 Square 轻松收取信用卡付款。如需开始使用或了解更多信息，请参阅我们的 <a href="%s" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Square 文档</a>。','Square payments can\'t be processed because there\'s a problem with the account connection.'=>'由于账户连接出现问题，无法处理 Square 支付。','--- Select Billing Address ---'=>'--- 选择账单地址 ---','Select the field that contains the billing\'s address. This field is optional.'=>'请选择包含账单地址的字段。该字段为可选字段。','Billing Address'=>'账单地址','Select the field that contains the customer\'s Address. This field is optional.'=>'请选择包含客户地址的字段。该字段为可选字段。','Square Pro'=>'Square Pro','Multiple Subscriptions'=>'多个订阅','Select the field that contains the customer\'s name. This field is required.'=>'请选择包含客户姓名的字段。该字段为必填项。','Phase Cadence'=>'阶段周期','Select the field that contains the billing\'s name. This field is optional.'=>'请选择包含收款人姓名的字段。该字段为可选字段。','--- Select Billing Name ---'=>'--- 选择账单名称 ---','The WPForms Square addon is out of date. To avoid payment processing issues, please upgrade the Square addon to the latest version.'=>'WPForms 的 Square 插件已过时。为避免支付处理出现问题，请将 Square 插件升级至最新版本。','This smart tag does not point to an Email field in your form.'=>'此智能标签未指向表单中的“电子邮件”字段。','Open in Popup'=>'在弹出窗口中打开','Dock to the Right'=>'靠右停靠','Dock to the Left'=>'靠左停靠','Invalid revision. The revision does not belong to this form.'=>'版本无效。该版本不属于此表单。','You do not have permission to restore revisions for this form.'=>'您没有权限恢复此表单的修订版本。','Failed to delete the template.'=>'无法删除该模板。','Template not found.'=>'未找到模板。','You do not have permission to delete this template.'=>'您没有权限删除此模板。','Copy webhook URL'=>'复制 webhook URL','Add New Form'=>'添加新表单','Search'=>'搜索','Sorry, no results found'=>'抱歉，未找到结果','Smart Tags'=>'智能标签','Quiz functionality will not be present in the published form. <a href="%1$s" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Upgrade now</a> to unlock the Quiz Addon.'=>'发布后的表单中将不包含测验功能。<a href="%1$s" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">立即升级</a>以解锁测验插件。','Market vendor application'=>'市场摊位申请表','Takeout order for a pizza store'=>'披萨店的外卖订单','Cancellation survey for a subscription'=>'订阅取消调查','Job application for a web designer'=>'网页设计师职位申请','Online event registration'=>'在线活动报名','Restaurant customer satisfaction survey'=>'餐厅顾客满意度调查','You can make up to 50 AI requests per day. If you believe this is an error, <a href="%s" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">please contact WPForms support</a>.'=>'您每天最多可发起 50 次 AI 请求。如果您认为这是错误，<a href="%s" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">请联系 WPForms 支持团队</a>。','<a href="#" class="%1$s">Reload this window</a> and try again.'=>'<a href="#" class="%1$s">重新加载此窗口</a>，然后重试。','Happy with the results? Let\'s put this form to work!'=>'对结果满意吗？那就让这个表单派上用场吧！','Does this form align with your goals? Are you ready to implement it?'=>'这份表格符合您的目标吗？您准备好实施它了吗？','Satisfied with the form? Let\'s use it!'=>'对这个表单满意吗？那就用起来吧！','Is this form what you were envisioning? Are you ready to use it?'=>'这个表单符合您的预期吗？您准备好使用它了吗？','Does this form meet your expectations? Can we move on to the next step?'=>'这份表格符合您的预期吗？我们可以进入下一步了吗？','Are you pleased with the outcome? Ready to use this form?'=>'您对结果满意吗？准备好使用此表单了吗？','Is this form a good fit for your needs? Can we proceed?'=>'这份表格符合您的需求吗？我们可以继续吗？','Your Form Contains Pro Fields'=>'您的表单包含专业版字段','You do not have permission to preview form.'=>'您无权预览该表单。','Untitled Form'=>'无标题表单','Happy with the form? Ready to move forward?'=>'对这份表格满意吗？准备好继续下一步了吗？','Is this what you had in mind? Are you satisfied with the results?'=>'这就是你想要的效果吗？你对结果满意吗？','Does this look good? Are you ready to implement this form?'=>'这样看起来怎么样？你准备好实现这个表单了吗？','How’s that? Are you ready to use this form?'=>'怎么样？你准备好使用这个表单了吗？','What do you think of the form I created for you? If you’re happy with it, you can use this form. Otherwise, make changes by entering additional prompts.'=>'你觉得我为你创建的表单怎么样？如果你满意的话，可以直接使用这个表单。否则，可以通过输入额外的提示来进行修改。','Can\'t install or activate the required addons.'=>'无法安装或激活所需的插件。','Addons Activation Error'=>'插件激活错误','Addons Installation Error'=>'插件安装错误','You’re all set. We’re going to reload the builder and you can start building your form.'=>'一切就绪。我们将重新加载表单生成器，您可以开始制作表单了。','Addons Activated'=>'已启用插件','Addons Installed'=>'已安装的插件','Okay'=>'好的','Don\'t show this again'=>'不再显示此提示','No, Thanks'=>'不，谢谢','Yes, Install'=>'是的，安装','In order to build the best forms possible, we need to activate some addons. Would you like to activate the recommended addons?'=>'为了构建出最佳表单，我们需要启用一些插件。您是否要启用推荐的插件？','In order to build the best forms possible, we need to install some addons. Would you like to install the recommended addons?'=>'为了构建出最佳的表单，我们需要安装一些插件。您是否要安装推荐的插件？','Before We Proceed'=>'在继续之前','Click "Use This Form" to start editing.'=>'点击“使用此表单”开始编辑。','This is just a preview of your form.'=>'这只是您表单的预览。','Update required'=>'需要更新','Update Addon'=>'更新插件','Activate Addon'=>'激活插件','The %1$s is not compatible with this version of WPForms and requires an update.'=>'%1$s 与该版本的 WPForms 不兼容，需要进行更新。','You have access to the %1$s, but it\'s not currently activated.'=>'您可以访问 %1$s，但该功能目前尚未激活。','You have access to the %1$s, but it\'s not currently installed.'=>'您可以访问 %1$s，但它目前尚未安装。','Upgrade to gain access to the %1$s field and dozens of other powerful features to help you build smarter forms and grow your business.'=>'升级即可使用 %1$s 字段以及其他数十项强大功能，助您创建更智能的表单并拓展业务。','Incompatible Addon'=>'不兼容的插件','%1$s is a Pro Feature'=>'%1$s 是一项 Pro 功能','Determines the increment between selectable values on the field.'=>'确定字段中可选值之间的增量。','Define the minimum and the maximum values for the field.'=>'请为该字段定义最小值和最大值。','Field Style'=>'字段样式','Check this option to store files in the WordPress Media Library.'=>'选中此选项可将文件存储在 WordPress 媒体库中。','Store files in WordPress Media Library'=>'将文件存储在 WordPress 媒体库中','telephone, mobile, cell'=>'电话、移动电话、手机','Strong'=>'强','Weak'=>'弱','Select minimum password strength level.'=>'选择最低密码强度级别。','Minimum Strength'=>'最小强度','Check this option to set minimum password strength.'=>'选中此选项可设置密码的最低强度。','Enable Password Strength'=>'启用密码强度检查','Check this option to ask users to provide their password twice.'=>'选中此选项，要求用户输入两次密码。','Enable Password Confirmation'=>'启用密码确认','First Page / Progress Indicator'=>'首页 / 进度指示器','By default, a user\'s view is pulled to the top of each form page. Set to ON to disable this animation.'=>'默认情况下，用户的视图会拉动到每个表单页面的顶部。将此选项设置为“开启”可禁用此动画效果。','Disable Scroll Animation'=>'禁用滚动动画','Split'=>'拆分','Center'=>'中心','Right'=>'右','uri, link, hyperlink'=>'统一资源标识符、链接、超链接','You’re about to overwrite your existing form. This will delete all fields and reset external connections. Are you sure you want to continue?'=>'您即将覆盖现有的表单。这将删除所有字段并重置外部连接。您确定要继续吗？','<a href="#">Upgrade to Pro</a> and gain access to all fields and create the best possible forms.'=>'<a href="#">升级至专业版</a>，即可访问所有字段并创建最优质的表单。','This Form Would Be Even Better With Fields From'=>'如果此表单包含以下字段，将会更加完善：','Can\'t dismiss the modal window.'=>'无法关闭模式窗口。','Not sure where to begin? Use our Generative AI tool to get started or take your pick from our wide variety of fields and start building out your form!'=>'不知道从哪里开始？使用我们的生成式人工智能工具开始操作，或者从我们丰富的字段选项中任选其一，开始构建您的表单吧！','Build Your Form Fast With the Help of AI'=>'借助人工智能快速构建表单','Back to Templates'=>'返回模板','NEW!'=>'NEW!','Continue Generating'=>'继续生成','Generate Form'=>'生成表单','Write simple prompts to create complex forms catered to your specific needs.'=>'编写简单的提示语，即可创建符合您特定需求的复杂表单。','Generate With AI'=>'使用 AI 生成','Sorry, you are not allowed to dismiss.'=>'抱歉，您无法撤销此操作。','Please specify an element.'=>'请指定一个元素。','Form could not be created.'=>'无法创建表单。','Scale'=>'比例','review, emoji, star'=>'评论、表情符号、星级','Smart'=>'智能','Select format for the phone form field'=>'为电话号码输入框选择格式','Left'=>'左','Select the alignment for the Next/Previous page navigation buttons'=>'选择“下一页/上一页”导航按钮的对齐方式','Page Navigation Alignment'=>'页面导航对齐方式','Select the primary color for the Page Indicator theme.'=>'选择“页面指示器”主题的主色。','Page Indicator Color'=>'页码指示器颜色','Select theme for Page Indicator which is displayed at the top of the form.'=>'为表单顶部显示的“页面指示器”选择主题。','Progress Indicator'=>'进度指示器','Connector'=>'连接器','Circles'=>'圆圈','Progress Bar'=>'进度条','Enter text for Previous page navigation button.'=>'请输入“上一页”导航按钮的文本。','The following fields ({fields}) cannot be attached to notifications because restrictions are