ice'=>'显示预览提示','Generate a Form'=>'生成表单','The challenge will continue once AI form generation is complete'=>'一旦 AI 表单生成完成，挑战将继续进行','Form database object not found.'=>'未找到表单数据库对象。','Empty form data.'=>'表单数据为空。','Empty field data.'=>'字段数据为空。','Empty prompt.'=>'提示符为空。','Check this option to allow uploading and embedding files.'=>'勾选此选项以允许上传和嵌入文件。','Allow Media Uploads'=>'允许上传媒体文件','Select the color for the rating icon'=>'选择评分图标的颜色','Select the size of the rating icon'=>'选择评分图标的大小','Smiley Face'=>'笑脸','Thumb'=>'缩略图','Heart'=>'心形','Star'=>'星星','Select icon to display'=>'点击图标以显示','File Upload Restrictions can\'t be enabled because the current version of the Post Submissions addon is incompatible.'=>'无法启用“文件上传限制”，因为当前版本的“Post Submissions”插件不兼容。','All User Roles already selected'=>'已选中所有用户角色','Select the users that can access the uploaded files.'=>'选择可以访问已上传文件的用户。','All users with selected roles will be able to access the uploaded files.'=>'所有具有指定角色的用户都将能够访问上传的文件。','Select the user roles that can access the uploaded files.'=>'选择可以访问上传文件的用户角色。','Logged-in Users'=>'已登录用户','User Restriction'=>'用户限制','Choose who can access the uploaded files.'=>'选择谁可以访问已上传的文件。','Enable File Access Restrictions'=>'启用文件访问限制','Check this option to store the final uploaded file in the WordPress Media Library'=>'选中此选项，将最终上传的文件保存到 WordPress 媒体库中','Store Files in WordPress Media Library'=>'将文件存储在 WordPress 媒体库中','Modern Style supports multiple file uploads, displays a drag-and-drop upload box, and uses AJAX. Classic Style supports single file upload and displays a traditional upload button.'=>'现代样式支持批量文件上传，显示拖放上传框，并使用 AJAX。经典样式支持单个文件上传，并显示传统的上传按钮。','Enter the max number of files to allow. If left blank, the value defaults to 1.'=>'输入允许的最大文件数。如果留空，该值默认为1。','Max File Uploads'=>'最大文件上传数量','Enter the max size of each file, in megabytes, to allow. If left blank, the value defaults to the maximum size the server allows which is %s.'=>'请输入每个文件允许的最大大小（单位为兆字节）。如果留空，默认值为服务器允许的最大大小，即 %s。','An error occurred while generating form.'=>'生成表单时发生错误。','Use This Form'=>'请使用此表单','Go back to this version of the form'=>'返回此版本的表单','Describe the form you would like to create or use one of the example prompts below to get started.'=>'请描述您想要创建的表单，或使用以下示例提示之一开始操作。','code'=>'代码','Enter text for the form field label. Never displayed on the front-end.'=>'输入表单字段标签的文本。该文本绝不会在前端显示。','Max File Size'=>'最大文件大小','See More Details'=>'查看更多详情','Entry Preview must be displayed on its own page, without other fields. HTML fields are allowed.'=>'条目预览必须单独显示在一个页面上，且不包含其他字段。允许包含 HTML 字段。','confirm'=>'确认','line, hr'=>'行，水平分隔线','End Time'=>'结束时间','Start Time'=>'开始时间','Check this option to prevent any previous date from being selected.'=>'选中此选项可防止选择任何早于当前日期的日期。','Disable Past Dates'=>'禁用过往日期','Check this option to adjust the range of times that can be selected.'=>'选中此选项可调整可选时间范围。','Icon'=>'图标','Select rating scale'=>'选择评分标准','Previous Label'=>'上一条标签','Toggle displaying the Previous page navigation button.'=>'切换显示上一页导航按钮。','Display Previous'=>'显示上一页','Next'=>'下一页','Enter text for Next page navigation button.'=>'输入下一页导航按钮的文本。','Next Label'=>'下一个标签','Enter text for the page title.'=>'请输入页面标题。','Page Title'=>'页面标题','progress bar, multi step, multi part'=>'进度条、多步骤、多部分','Contents of this field are not displayed in the form builder preview.'=>'该字段的内容不会在表单构建器的预览中显示。','Enter text for the form field label. It will help identify your HTML blocks inside the form builder, but will not be displayed in the form.'=>'请输入表单字段标签的文本。这有助于在表单构建器中识别您的 HTML 代码块，但不会在表单中显示。','Tue'=>'星期二','Mon'=>'星期一','Sun'=>'星期日','Check this option to adjust which days of the week can be selected.'=>'选中此选项可设置允许选择的具体星期几。','Limit Days'=>'限制天数','Interval'=>'间隔','Advanced time options.'=>'高级时间选项','1 hour'=>'1小时','30 minutes'=>'30分钟','15 minutes'=>'15分钟','Date Dropdown'=>'日期下拉菜单','Date Picker'=>'日期选择器','Advanced date options.'=>'高级日期选项。','Time'=>'时间','Date and Time'=>'日期和时间','ZIP / Postal'=>'邮政编码','Turn On if you want to hide this sub field.'=>'如果要隐藏此子字段，请勾选