eeded.'=>'轻松管理用户提交的内容。允许用户在 WordPress 中提交客座博客文章。您可以根据需要添加或删除表单字段。','Blog Post Submission Form'=>'博客文章投稿表单','Allow your users to easily reset their password.'=>'允许用户轻松重置密码。','User Password Reset Form'=>'用户密码重置表单','Allow your users to easily log in to your site with their username and password.'=>'让您的用户能够使用用户名和密码轻松登录您的网站。','User Login Form'=>'用户登录表单','Create customized WordPress user registration forms and add them anywhere on your website.'=>'创建自定义的 WordPress 用户注册表单，并将其添加到网站的任意位置。','User Registration Form'=>'用户注册表','Featured'=>'精选','New'=>'新增','Troubleshooting and Support'=>'故障排除与支持','Extending Functionality'=>'扩展功能','Spam Prevention and Security'=>'垃圾邮件防范与安全','Payment Processing'=>'支付处理','Form Management'=>'表单管理','Form Creation'=>'表单创建','Back to All Entries'=>'返回所有条目','Explore Entries & Learn More'=>'浏览条目并了解更多','Item %d'=>'项目 %d','Field ID #%s'=>'字段 ID #%s','Solve common email deliverability issues for good.'=>'彻底解决常见的电子邮件送达问题。','It looks like the form you had selected is in the Trash or has been permanently deleted.'=>'您选择的表单似乎已在回收站中，或者已被永久删除。','Network error or server is unreachable. Check your connection or try again later.'=>'网络错误或无法连接到服务器。请检查您的网络连接，或稍后再试。','Error updating token. Please try again or contact support if the issue persists.'=>'更新令牌时发生错误。请重试；如果问题仍然存在，请联系客服。','Please reload the page and try submitting the form again.'=>'请刷新页面，然后再次尝试提交表单。','Antispam filter did not allow your data to pass through.'=>'反垃圾邮件过滤器未允许您的数据通过。','Antispam token is invalid.'=>'反垃圾邮件令牌无效‌。','You\'re using an older version of the %1$s addon that does not support the Repeater field.'=>'您正在使用的是 %1$s 插件的旧版本，该版本不支持“Repeater”字段。','New Email Submit'=>'提交新邮件','Measure customer loyalty and find out exactly what they are thinking with this enhanced Net Promoter Score survey template.'=>'‌借助这款增强版净推荐值调研模板，衡量客户忠诚度，并精准洞察他们的真实想法。','Repeater'=>'重复器','Duplicate Form'=>'表单重复','Duplicate Template'=>'模板重复','Save your custom forms to the templates library for quick and easy use.'=>'将自定义表单保存到模板库中，以便快速