版本，该版本不支持订单摘要功能。','The following addons require an update to support product quantities: %1$s'=>'以下插件需要更新才能支持产品数量：%1$s','Upgrade to Pro Today'=>'立即升级至专业版','Add advanced form fields and conditional logic, plus offer more payment options, manage entries, and connect to your favorite marketing tools – all when you purchase a premium plan.'=>'购买高级套餐后，您即可添加高级表单字段和条件逻辑，提供更多支付选项，管理提交信息，并连接您常用的营销工具。','Start Building Smarter WordPress Forms'=>'开始构建更智能的 WordPress 表单','What’s New in WPForms'=>'WPForms 的新功能','View WPForms Announcements'=>'查看 WPForms 公告','Check out the latest releases from WPForms. Our team is always innovating to bring you powerful features and functionality that are simple to use. Every release is designed with you in mind!'=>'快来看看 WPForms 的最新版本。我们的团队始终致力于创新，为您带来功能强大且易于使用的特性。每个版本的设计都以您为中心！','Quantity'=>'数量','Item'=>'项目','New Feature'=>'新功能','Order Summary'=>'订单摘要','Coupon (%s)'=>'优惠券 (%s)','Subtotal'=>'小计','Other Styles'=>'其他样式','Show order summary after confirmation message'=>'在确认消息后显示订单摘要','Example Product 3'=>'示例产品 3','Example Product 2'=>'示例产品 2','WPForms Announcements'=>'WPForms 公告','Range'=>'范围','Enable Quantity'=>'启用数量','Set the minimum and maximum quantity for this product.'=>'请为该产品设置最小和最大订购数量。','Enable quantity for this product to allow customers to purchase more than one.'=>'启用此商品的数量选项，以便顾客可以购买多件。','Hey, there! It looks like you enjoy creating forms with WPForms. Would you do us a favor and take a few seconds to give us a 5-star review? We’d love to hear from you.'=>'嗨！看来你很喜欢用 WPForms 制作表单。能否帮个忙，花几秒钟给我们留下五星好评？我们很期待听到你的反馈。','Plugins → Installed Plugins'=>'插件 → 已安装的插件','Network Admin → Plugins → Installed Plugins'=>'网络管理员 → 插件 → 已安装的插件','There are no products selected.'=>'尚未选择任何产品。','%1$s &times; %2$d'=>'%1$s × %2$d','Heads up! It looks like there\'s a problem with your domain verification, and Stripe Apple Pay may stop working. If this notice does not disappear in a day, <a href="%1$s" rel="nofollow noopener" target="_blank">please register it manually.</a>'=>'请注意！您的域名验证似乎出现了问题，Stripe Apple Pay 可能会停止工作。如果此通知在一天内未消失，<a href="%1$s" rel="nofollow noopener" target="_blank">请手动进行注册。</a>','Customer Name'=>'客户姓名','Select the field that contains the customer\'s name. This is optional but recommended.'=>'请选择包含客户姓名的字段。此步骤虽非强制，但建议执行。','--- Select Name ---'=>'--- 选择姓名 ---','Need some help? Check out our'=>'需要帮助吗？请查看我们的','comprehensive guide'=>'综合指南','Minimum Price: %1$s'=>'最低价格：%1$s','Amount can\'t be less than the required minimum.'=>'金额不得低于规定的最低限额。','Minimum Price: <span class="min-price">%1$s</span>'=>'最低价格：<span class="min-price">%1$s</span>','Price: <span class="price">%1$s</span>'=>'价格：<span class="price">%1$s</span>','Security Recommendation'=>'安全建议','Requiring a minimum price of at least %1$s helps protect you against card testing by fraudsters.'=>'将最低价格设定为至少 %1$s，有助于防范欺诈者利用信用卡进行测试。','Enter the minimum price of the item, without a currency symbol.'=>'请输入该商品的最低价格，无需添加货币符号。','There was an error saving your form. Please check your file and try again.'=>'保存表单时出现错误。请检查您的文件，然后重试。','The unfiltered HTML permissions are required to import form.'=>'导入表单需要未经过滤的 HTML 权限。','Showing the first %1$s choices.<br> All %2$s choices will be displayed when viewing the form.'=>'显示前 %1$s 个选项。<br> 查看表单时将显示所有 %2$s 个选项。','Credit Card'=>'信用卡','Payment Required'=>'需付款','Couldn\'t load the Setup panel.'=>'无法加载安装面板。','You tried uploading a file type that is not allowed. Please try again.'=>'您尝试上传的文件类型不被允许。请重试。','Unknown error.'=>'未知错误。','Are you sure you want to trash %s entries? This will also remove all associated files, notes, and logs.'=>'您确定要删除 %s 条目吗？此操作还将删除所有相关的文件、笔记和日志。','Are you sure you want to trash ALL entries? This will also remove all associated files, notes, and logs.'=>'您确定要删除所有条目吗？此操作还将删除所有相关的文件、笔记和日志。','Are you sure you want to trash this entry? This will also remove all associated files, notes, and logs.'=>'您确定要删除此条目吗？此操作还将删除所有相关的文件、笔记和日志。','Are you sure you want to delete %s entries? This will also remove all associated files, notes, and logs.'=>'您确定要删除 %s 条目吗？此操作还将删除所有相关的文件、笔记和日志。','Are you sure you want to delete ALL entries? This will also remove all associated files, notes, and logs.'=>'您确定要删除所有条目吗？此操作还将删除所有相关的文件、笔记和日志。','Are you sure you want to delete this entry? This will also remove all associated files, notes, and logs.'=>'您确定要删除此条目吗？此操作还将删除所有相关的文件、笔记和日志。','Sorry, there is no entry meta that match your criteria.'=>'抱歉，没有符合您搜索条件的条目元数据。','Sorry, there are no form fields that match your criteria.'=>'抱歉，没有符合您条件的表单字段。','Change columns to display'=>'更改要显示的列','This color combination may be hard to read. Try increasing the contrast between the body and text colors.'=>'这种配色方案可能难以辨认。请尝试提高正文与文字颜色的对比度。','ID'=>'ID','Please complete the setup in your <a href="%1$s" target="_blank">WPForms Settings</a>, and check out <a href="%2$s" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">our guide</a> to learn about available CAPTCHA solutions.'=>'请在您的 <a href="%1$s" target="_blank">WPForms 设置</a> 中完成配置，并查看 <a href="%2$s" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">我们的指南</a>，了解可用的 CAPTCHA 解决方案。','Install and activate'=>'安装并激活','Invalid panel.'=>'面板无效。','Restore Entries'=>'恢复条目','Sorry, we didn\'t find any addons that match your criteria.'=>'抱歉，我们没有找到符合您条件的任何插件。','%s logo'=>'%s 标志','Plugin installation is disabled for this site.'=>'此网站已禁用插件安装功能。','Could not install the addon. Please <a href="%1$s" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">download it from wpforms.com</a> and <a href="%2$s" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">install it manually</a>, or <a href="%3$s" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">contact support</a> for assistance.'=>'无法安装该插件。请 <a href="%1$s" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">从 wpforms.com 下载</a>，并<a href="%2$s" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">手动安装</a>，或者<a href="%3$s" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">联系支持团队</a>寻求帮助。','Edit Smart Logic'=>'编辑智能逻辑','Show Label'=>'显示标签','Mark as Required'=>'标记为必填','Mark as Optional'=>'标记为可选','Translation'=>'翻译','Access controls allows you to manage and customize access to WPForms functionality. You can easily grant or restrict access using the simple built-in controls, or use our official integrations with Members and User Role Editor plugins.'=>'访问控制功能可让您管理和自定义对 WPForms 各项功能的访问权限。您可以使用简单的内置控制项轻松授予或限制访问权限，也可以使用我们与 Members 和 User Role Editor 插件的官方集成。','Access powerful marketing and payment integrations, advanced form fields, and more when you purchase our Plus, Pro, or Elite plans.'=>'购买我们的 Plus、Pro 或 Elite 套餐，即可使用强大的营销和支付集成功能、高级表单字段等更多功能。','Upgrade to Unlock WPForms Addons'=>'升级以解锁 WPForms 插件','<a href="%1$s" class="wpforms-btn-preview" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Preview Email Template</a>'=>'<a href="%1$s" class="wpforms-btn-preview" target="_blank" rel="noopener">预览电子邮件模板</a>','Upload or choose a logo to be displayed at the top of email notifications. Light mode image will be used if not set.'=>'上传或选择一个徽标，该徽标将显示在电子邮件通知的顶部。如果未设置，系统将使用浅色模式的图片。','Modern email clients support viewing emails in light and dark modes. You can upload a header image and customize the style for each appearance mode independently to ensure an optimal reading experience.'=>'现代电子邮件客户端支持以浅色模式和深色模式查看邮件。您可以上传封面图片，并针对每种显示模式独立自定义样式，以确保最佳的阅读体验。','Appearance'=>'外观','Columns'=>'列数','Cannot save columns order.'=>'无法保存列的顺序。','Amount entered is less than the required minimum.'=>'输入的金额低于最低要求。','Minimum Price'=>'最低价格','It looks like you\'ve downgraded to an older version of WPForms. We recommend always using the latest version as some features may not function as expected in older versions. <a href="%1$s" target="_blank" rel="noopener">%2$s</a>'=>'看起来您已将 WPForms 降级到了旧版本。我们建议您始终使用最新版本，因为某些功能在旧版本中可能无法按预期运行。<a href="%1$s" target="_blank" rel="noopener">%2$s</a>','Please Update WPCode to Use the WPForms Snippet Library'=>'请更新 WPCode 以使用 WPForms 代码片段库','Install + Activate WPCode'=>'安装 + 激活 WPCode','Please Install WPCode to Use the WPForms Snippet Library'=>'请安装 WPCode 以使用 WPForms 代码片段库','Sent from <a href="%1$s">%2$s</a>'=>'发件人：<a href="%1$s">%2$s</a>','Browse through our collection of email notification templates.'=>'浏览我们的电子邮件通知模板合集。','Choose a Template'=>'选择一个模板','Select a template to use for this notification or %1$sview templates%2$s.'=>'请选择一个模板用于此通知，或 %1$s 查看模板 %2$s。','since %1$s'=>'自 %1$s 以来','Tech'=>'技术支持','Field ID #%1$s'=>'字段 ID #%1$s','Legacy'=>'传统','Code Snippets'=>'代码片段','Some style settings are not available when using the Legacy template. <a href="%1$s" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Learn More</a>'=>'使用 Legacy 模板时，部分样式设置不可用。<a href="%1$s" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">了解更多</a>','Take payments with Stripe, PayPal, Square, & Authorize.Net'=>'支持通过 Stripe、PayPal、Square 和 Authorize.Net 收款','Make surveys and generate reports'=>'制作调查问卷并生成报告','Create powerful custom calculation forms'=>'创建功能强大的自定义计算表单','Choose the style that’s applied to all text in email notifications.'=>'选择要应用于电子邮件通知中所有文本的样式。','Typography'=>'排版','Links'=>'链接','are a %s Feature'=>'是 %s 功能','Default Template'=>'默认模板','Override the default email template for this specific notification.'=>'覆盖此特定通知的默认电子邮件模板。','Email Template'=>'电子邮件模板','Choose'=>'选择','Email Templates'=>'电子邮件模板','Export entries to Google Sheets, Excel, and CSV'=>'将条目导出到 Google 表格、Excel 和 CSV','Compact'=>'紧凑','Sorry, we didn\'t find any snippets that match your criteria.'=>'抱歉，我们没有找到符合您条件的代码片段。','Installed'=>'已安装','Using WPCode, you can install WPForms code snippets with 1 click directly from this page or the <a href="%s" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">WPCode library</a>.'=>'使用 WPCode，您可以直接从本页面或 <a href="%s" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">WPCode 代码库</a>，一键安装 WPForms 代码片段。','Learn more about WPCode'=>'了解有关 WPCode 的更多信息','Using WPCode, you can install WPForms code snippets with 1 click right from this page or the WPCode Library in the WordPress admin.'=>'使用 WPCode，您可以直接从本页面或 WordPress 管理后台的 WPCode 代码库中，一键安装 WPForms 代码片段。','Activate WPCode'=>'激活 WPCode','Please Activate WPCode to Use the WPForms Snippet Library'=>'请激活 WPCode 以使用 WPForms 代码片段库','Update + Activate WPCode'=>'更新并激活 WPCode','Install Snippet'=>'安装代码片段','Edit Snippet'=>'编辑代码片段','Search Snippets'=>'搜索代码片段','Elegant'=>'优雅','Serif'=>'衬线字体','Sans Serif'=>'无衬线字体‌','Body'=>'‌正文背景','Enable Calculation'=>'启用计算','Calculations'=>'计算','AI Calculations Are Here!'=>'AI 计算来了！','Easily perform calculations based on user input. Head over to the <a href="#advanced-tab">Advanced Tab</a> to get started or read <a href="%1$s" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">our documentation</a> to learn more.'=>'根据用户输入轻松进行计算。请前往 <a href="#advanced-tab">“高级”选项卡</a> 开始操作，或阅读 <a href="%1$s" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">我们的文档</a> 以了解更多信息。','Payment ID'=>'付款 ID','Subscription Renewal History Table'=>'订阅续订历史记录表','We\'re sorry that it took longer than %1$d %2$s to publish your form. Our goal is to create the most beginner-friendly WordPress form plugin.<br>How can we help you to be successful? Please send us your feedback. Our support team is standing by to help.'=>'很抱歉，发布您的表单花费的时间超过了 %1$d %2$s。我们的目标是打造最适合初学者的 WordPress 表单插件。<br>我们能为您提供什么帮助，助您取得成功？请向我们反馈您的意见。我们的支持团队随时准备为您提供帮助。','Do you need more help?'=>'还需要其他帮助吗？','There must be a non-developer Lite version installed to upgrade.'=>'要进行升级，必须先安装非开发者版 Lite 版本。','Heads up! Looks like you have a problem with your webhooks configuration. Please check and confirm that you\'ve configured the WPForms webhooks in your Stripe account. This notice will disappear automatically when a new Stripe request comes in. See our <a href="%1$s" rel="nofollow noopener" target="_blank">documentation</a> for more information.'=>'请注意！您的 Webhooks 配置似乎存在问题。请检查并确认您已在 Stripe 账户中配置了 WPForms Webhooks。当收到新的 Stripe 请求时，此提示将自动消失。更多信息请参阅我们的 <a href="%1$s" rel="nofollow noopener" target="_blank">文档</a>。','Stripe Subscription payment stopped, validation error.'=>'Stripe 订阅付款已停止，验证错误。','It seems to be request to Stripe PHP Listener method handler but the site is not configured to use it.'=>'这似乎是向 Stripe PHP Listener 方法处理程序发出的请求，但该网站尚未配置使用该功能。','Webhooks Method'=>'Webhooks 方法','Stripe uses webhooks to notify WPForms when an event has occurred in your Stripe account. Please see <a href="%s" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">our documentation on Stripe webhooks</a> for full details.'=>'当您的 Stripe 账户中发生某项事件时，Stripe 会通过 webhook 通知 WPForms。有关详细信息，请参阅 <a href="%s" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">我们关于 Stripe webhook 的文档</a>。','Enable Webhooks'=>'启用 Webhooks','Securely connect to Stripe with just a few clicks to begin accepting payments! <a href="%s" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="wpforms-learn-more">Learn More</a>'=>'只需点击几下，即可安全连接到 Stripe，开始接收付款！<a href="%s" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="wpforms-learn-more">了解更多</a>','The used Stripe payment collection type doesn\'t support this action.<br><br> Please <a href=\'%s\'>update your payment collection type</a> to continue processing payments successfully.'=>'当前使用的 Stripe 收款类型不支持此操作。<br><br> 请 <a href=\'%s\'>更新您的收款类型</a>，以便继续成功处理付款。','Updating subscription in the database failed.'=>'更新数据库中的订阅失败。','Subscription cancelled.'=>'订阅已取消。','Subscription cancellation failed.'=>'订阅取消失败。','Subscription not found in the database.'=>'数据库中未找到该订阅。','Payment ID not provided.'=>'未提供付款ID。','Saving refund in the database failed.'=>'无法将退款信息保存到数据库中。','Refund successful.'=>'退款成功。','Refund failed.'=>'退款失败。','Payment not found in the database.'=>'数据库中未找到该笔付款。','Missing payment ID.'=>'缺少付款ID。','This route is private.'=>'该路线为私人路线。','Partially Refunded'=>'部分退款','Copy System Information'=>'复制系统信息','Start logging WPForms-related events. This is recommended only while debugging.'=>'开始记录与 WPForms 相关的事件。仅建议在调试时使用此功能。','Log Settings'=>'日志设置','Choose a File'=>'选择文件','Export a Form Template'=>'导出表单模板','Use form export files to create a backup of your forms or to import forms to another site.'=>'使用表单导出文件来备份您的表单，或将表单导入到另一个网站。','Export Forms'=>'导出表单','A CAPTCHA is an anti-spam technique which helps to protect your website from spam and abuse while letting real people pass through with ease.'=>'验证码是一种反垃圾邮件技术，有助于保护您的网站免受垃圾邮件和滥用，同时让真实的人轻松通过。','Payment History'=>'付款记录','You can\'t edit this payment because it\'s in the trash.'=>'您无法编辑此笔付款，因为它已移至回收站。','Subscription was successfully canceled!'=>'订阅已成功取消！','Payment was successfully refunded!'=>'付款已成功退款！','Are you sure you want to cancel this subscription?'=>'您确定要取消此订阅吗？','types'=>'类型','Deleting one or more selected payments may prevent processing of future subscription renewals. Payment filtering may also be affected. <a href="%1$s" rel="noopener" target="_blank">Learn More</a>'=>'删除一项或多项选定的付款可能会导致无法处理未来的订阅续订。付款筛选功能也可能受到影响。<a href="%1$s" rel="noopener" target="_blank">了解更多</a>','No subscription renewals for the selected period'=>'所选期间内无订阅续期','No new subscriptions for selected period'=>'所选期间内无新订阅','No refunds for selected period'=>'指定期间内不予退款','Coupons Redeemed'=>'已兑换的优惠券','Subscription Renewals'=>'订阅续期','New Subscriptions'=>'新订阅','Total Refunded'=>'退款总额','View payments'=>'查看付款记录','View Payments'=>'查看付款','Last Modified<br/>%1$s'=>'最后修改时间<br/>%1$s','Created<br/>%1$s'=>'创建于<br/>%1$s','All forms, entries, and uploaded files will be unrecoverable.'=>'所有表单、填写内容和上传的文件都将无法恢复。','All forms and settings will be unrecoverable.'=>'所有表单和设置都将无法恢复。','Retrieve your %1$s from your <a href="%2$s" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Stripe webhook settings</a>. Select the endpoint, then click Reveal.'=>'请从您的 <a href="%2$s" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Stripe Webhook 设置</a> 中获取您的 %1$s。选择端点，然后点击“显示”。','Test Mode Signing Secret'=>'测试模式签名密钥','REST API (recommended)'=>'REST API (推荐)','What\'s new?'=>'有什么新动态？','A new and improved Stripe interface is available when you create new forms.'=>'在创建新表单时，您可以使用全新且经过优化的 Stripe 界面。','A new and improved Stripe interface is available with new Stripe Pro addon.'=>'随着新的 Stripe Pro 插件的推出，全新升级的 Stripe 界面现已上线。','Learn more about our Stripe integration.'=>'了解有关我们与 Stripe 集成的更多信息。','Connect WPForms to Stripe.'=>'将 WPForms 与 Stripe 连接起来。','To use Stripe, first add the Stripe payment field to your form.'=>'要使用 Stripe，首先需将 Stripe 支付字段添加到表单中。','Stripe Pro'=>'Stripe Pro','Allow your customer to pay recurringly via the form.'=>'允许您的客户通过表单进行定期支付。','Recurring Payments '=>'定期付款 ','Allow your customers to one-time pay via the form.'=>'允许您的客户通过表单进行一次性支付。','Enable one-time payments'=>'启用单次支付','One-Time Payments'=>'一次性付款','You can only use one payment type at a time. If you\'d like to enable One-Time Payments, please disable Recurring Payments.'=>'您每次只能使用一种支付方式。如果您想启用“一次性支付”，请先禁用“定期支付”。','subscriptions'=>'订阅','gateways'=>'网关','Remove ALL WPForms data upon plugin deletion.'=>'删除插件时清除所有 WPForms 数据。','Hide the WPForms admin bar menu.'=>'隐藏 WPForms 管理栏菜单。','Hide plugin announcements and update details.'=>'隐藏插件公告和更新详情。','Enable the ability to CC: email addresses in the form notification settings.'=>'在表单通知设置中启用抄送电子邮件地址的功能。','Send emails asynchronously, which can make processing faster but may delay email delivery by a minute or two. <a href="%1$s" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="wpforms-learn-more">Learn More</a>'=>'异步发送电子邮件，这可以加快处理速度，但可能会导致电子邮件延迟一两分钟送达。<a href="%1$s" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="wpforms-learn-more">了解更多</a>','Upload or choose a logo to be displayed at the top of email notifications.'=>'上传或选择一个徽标，该徽标将显示在电子邮件通知的顶部。','Customize your email template and sending preferences.'=>'自定义您的电子邮件模板和发送偏好设置。','Enable GDPR related features and enhancements. <a href="%s" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="wpforms-learn-more">Learn More</a>'=>'启用与 GDPR 相关的功能和增强功能。 <a href="%s" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="wpforms-learn-more">了解更多</a>','Determines which CSS files to load and use for the site. "Base and Form Theme Styling" is recommended, unless you are experienced with CSS or instructed by support to change settings. <a href="%s" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="wpforms-learn-more">Learn More</a>'=>'用于确定网站应加载和使用哪些 CSS 文件。建议选择“基础和表单主题样式”，除非您精通 CSS，或经技术支持指导需更改设置。<a href="%s" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="wpforms-learn-more">了解更多</a>','Live Mode Signing Secret'=>'实时模式签名密钥','Retrieve your %1$s from your <a href="%2$s" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Stripe webhook settings</a>. Select the endpoint, then click Copy button.'=>'请从您的 <a href="%2$s" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Stripe Webhook 设置</a> 中获取您的 %1$s。选择端点，然后点击“复制”按钮。','Test Mode Endpoint ID'=>'测试模式端点 ID','Live Mode Endpoint ID'=>'实时模式端点 ID','Webhooks Live Secret'=>'Webhooks 实时密钥','Webhooks Test Secret'=>'Webhooks 测试密钥','Webhooks Test ID'=>'Webhooks 测试身份证','Webhooks Live ID'=>'Webhooks 实时身份证','Ensure an endpoint with the above URL is present in the <a href="%s" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Stripe webhook settings</a>.'=>'请确保在 <a href="%s" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Stripe Webhook 设置</a> 中包含一个指向上述 URL 的端点。','Webhooks Endpoint'=>'Webhooks 端点','Choose the method of communication between Stripe and WPForms. If REST API support is disabled for WordPress, use PHP listener. <a href="%s" rel="nofollow noopener" target="_blank">Learn more</a>.'=>'选择 Stripe 与 WPForms 之间的通信方式。如果 WordPress 禁用了 REST API 支持，请使用 PHP 监听器。<a href="%s" rel="nofollow noopener" target="_blank">了解更多</a>。','Filter entries by coupon'=>'按优惠券筛选条目','% Refunded'=>'% 已退款','equals'=>'等于','All %s'=>'全部 %s','Multiple %s selected'=>'已选择多个 %s','Miscellaneous'=>'杂项','PHP listener'=>'PHP 监听器','Add New Plan'=>'新建方案','You can only use one payment type at a time. If you\'d like to enable Recurring Payments, please disable One-Time Payments.'=>'您每次只能使用一种支付方式。如果您想启用“定期付款”，请先禁用“一次性付款”。','Are you sure you want to refund this payment?'=>'您确定要退还这笔款项吗？','with the subscription status'=>'带有订阅状态','with the type'=>'类型为','with the form titled'=>'表单标题为','with the coupon'=>'优惠券为','with the status'=>'状态为','where'=>'搜索范围','with the gateway'=>'与支付网关','Please enter a valid value or change the Increment. The nearest valid values