cription stopped. invalid PaymentIntent status.'=>'Stripe 订阅已停止。PaymentIntent 状态无效。','Stripe subscription stopped, missing PaymentMethod id.'=>'Stripe 订阅已停止，缺少 PaymentMethod ID。','Stripe payment was not confirmed. Please check your Stripe dashboard.'=>'Stripe 付款尚未确认。请查看您的 Stripe 仪表盘。','Stripe payment stopped. Invalid PaymentIntent status.'=>'Stripe 支付已停止。PaymentIntent 状态无效。','Link Email'=>'链接电子邮件','Payment Element'=>'付款元素','Card Element'=>'卡片元素','Credit Card Field Mode'=>'信用卡现场模式','Daily'=>'日常','Enter the subscription name. Eg: Email Newsletter. Subscription period and price are automatically appended. If left empty the form name will be used.'=>'输入订阅名称。例如：电子邮件通讯。订阅期限和价格将自动补充。若留空，则使用表单名称。','Select the field that contains the customer\'s email address. This is optional but recommended.'=>'请选择包含客户电子邮件地址的字段。此步骤虽非强制，但建议执行。','If you would like to have Stripe send a receipt after payment, select the email field to use. This is optional but recommended. Only used for standard one-time payments.'=>'如果您希望在付款后由 Stripe 发送收据，请选择要使用的电子邮件字段。此项为可选操作，但建议设置。仅适用于标准的一次性付款。','--- Select Email ---'=>'--- 选择邮箱 ---','Stripe Payment Receipt'=>'Stripe 支付收据','Enter your payment description. Eg: Donation for the soccer team. Only used for standard one-time payments.'=>'请输入付款备注。例如：给足球队的捐款。仅适用于标准的一次性付款。','Payment Description'=>'付款说明','Enable Stripe payments'=>'启用 Stripe 支付','The Stripe Pro addon is required to enable conditional logic for payments. Would you like to activate it?'=>'要启用支付的条件逻辑，必须安装 Stripe Pro 插件。您要激活它吗？','The Stripe Pro addon is required to enable conditional logic for payments. Would you like to install and activate it?'=>'要启用支付的条件逻辑，必须安装 Stripe Pro 插件。您要安装并激活它吗？','Amount can\'t be negative'=>'金额不能为负数','Show Price After Item Labels'=>'在商品标签后显示价格','Item %s'=>'项目 %s','Third Item'=>'第三项','Second Item'=>'第二项','First Item'=>'第一项','year'=>'年','semi-year'=>'半年','quarter'=>'季度','month'=>'月','week'=>'周','day'=>'天','Renewal'=>'续订','Cancelled'=>'已取消','Failed'=>'失败','Not Synced'=>'未同步','Bi