 Sheqel'=>'以色列新谢克尔','Hungarian Forint'=>'匈牙利福林','Hong Kong Dollar'=>'港元','Danish Krone'=>'丹麦克朗','Czech Koruna'=>'捷克克朗','Canadian Dollar'=>'加拿大元','Brazilian Real'=>'巴西雷亚尔','Australian Dollar'=>'澳元','Dismiss this notice'=>'关闭此提示','Solve common email deliverability issues for good. <a href="%1$s" target="%2$s" rel="noopener noreferrer">Get WP Mail SMTP!</a>'=>'彻底解决常见的电子邮件送达问题。<a href="%1$s" target="%2$s" rel="noopener noreferrer">立即获取 WP Mail SMTP！</a>','Make Sure Important Emails Reach Your Customers'=>'确保重要邮件能送达您的客户手中','You\'ve already created a form, now add it to the page so your customers can get in touch.'=>'您已经创建了一个表单，现在将其添加到页面中，以便客户能够与您联系。','Did you know that with <a href="%1$s" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">WPForms</a>, you can create an easy-to-use contact form in a matter of minutes?'=>'您知道吗？使用 <a href="%1$s" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">WPForms</a>，您只需几分钟就能创建一个易于使用的联系表单？','Embed your form'=>'嵌入表单','Oh hey, it looks like you\'re working on a contact page. Don\'t forget to embed your contact form. Click the plus icon above and search for WPForms.'=>'哦，嘿，看来你正在制作联系页面。别忘了嵌入联系表单。点击上方的加号图标，然后搜索 WPForms。','Easily add your contact form'=>'轻松添加您的联系表单','Get Started'=>'立即开始','Notifications can only use 1 From Email. Please do not enter multiple addresses.'=>'通知只能使用一个发件人邮箱地址。请勿输入多个地址。','Please enter a valid email address. Your notifications won\'t be sent if the field is not filled in correctly.'=>'请输入有效的电子邮件地址。如果该字段填写不正确，您将无法收到通知。','Don\'t forget to embed your contact form. Simply click the Add Form button below.'=>'别忘了嵌入你的联系方式。只需点击下面的添加表单按钮。','Then click on the WPForms block to embed your desired contact form.'=>'然后点击 WPForms 模块，嵌入您想要的联系表单。','Border'=>'边框','Background'=>'背景','Size'=>'大小','To change the styling for this form, open it in the form builder and edit the options in the Lead Forms settings.'=>'要更改此表单的样式，请在表单生成器中打开它，并编辑潜在客户表单设置中的选项。','Form Styles are disabled because Lead Form Mode is turned on.'=>'由于已启用潜在客户表单模式，因此表单样式已被禁用。','Enable modern markup in your WPForms settings to unlock the controls below.'=>'请在 WPForms 设置中启用现代标记功能，以解锁以下控件。','Update WordPress to the latest version to use our modern markup and unlock the controls below.'=>'请将 WordPress 更新至最新版本，以便使用我们的现代标记语言并解锁下方的控件。','Want to customize your form styles without editing CSS?'=>'想在不编辑 CSS 的情况下自定义表单样式吗？','Additional CSS Classes'=>'其他 CSS 类','Also used for other fields like Multiple Choice, Checkboxes, Rating, and NPS Survey.'=>'也可用于其他字段，如单选题、复选框、评分和净推荐值（NPS）调查。','Button Styles'=>'按钮样式','Label Styles'=>'标签样式','Field Styles'=>'字段样式','Submit button is disabled during form submission.'=>'表单提交期间，“提交”按钮处于禁用状态。','Error message'=>'错误消息','If you\'ve copied style settings from another form, you can paste them here to add the same styling to this form. Any current style settings will be overwritten.'=>'如果您已从另一个表单复制了样式设置，可以在此处粘贴，以便为该表单应用相同的样式。当前的任何样式设置都将被覆盖。','There was an error parsing your JSON code. Please check your code and try again.'=>'解析您的 JSON 代码时出现错误。请检查您的代码，然后重试。','Copy / Paste Style Settings'=>'复制 / 粘贴样式设置','Error Message'=>'错误信息','Sublabel & Hint'=>'子标签与提示','Colors'=>'颜色','Border Radius'=>'边框半径','Recaptcha error message'=>'Recaptcha 错误信息','Form error message'=>'表单错误提示','%s Empty message.'=>'%s 消息为空。','%s Empty subject line.'=>'%s 邮件主题为空','%1$s Invalid email address %2$s.'=>'%1$s 电子邮件地址 %2$s 无效。','<strong>You cannot use modern markup because you’re using the deprecated Credit Card field.</strong> If you’d like to use modern markup, replace your credit card field with a payment gateway like <a href="%s" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Stripe</a>.'=>'<strong>由于您正在使用已弃用的“信用卡”字段，因此无法使用现代标记语言。</strong> 如果您希望使用现代标记语言，请将“信用卡”字段替换为支付网关，例如 <a href="%s" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Stripe</a>。','Check this option to use modern markup, which has increased accessibility and allows you to easily customize your forms in the block editor. <a href="%s" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Read our form markup documentation</a> to learn more.'=>'选中此选项可使用现代标记语言，该标记语言提高了可访问性，并允许您在块编辑器中轻松自定义表单。<a href="%s" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">阅读我们的表单标记文档</a>以了解更多信息。','Use Modern Markup'=>'使用现代标记语言','Oh hey, it looks like you\'re working on a Contact page.'=>'哦，嘿，看来你正在制作“联系我们”页面呢。','Dismiss this notice.'=>'关闭此通知。','Cloudflare Turnstile verification failed, please try again later.'=>'Cloudflare Turnstile 验证失败，请稍后再试。','Not sure which service is right for you? <a href="%s" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Check out our comparison</a> for more details.'=>'不确定哪项服务最适合您？<a href="%s" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">请查看我们的对比表</a>以获取更多详情。','Cloudflare Turnstile'=>'Cloudflare Turnstile','Enable free, CAPTCHA-like spam protection that protects data privacy.'=>'启用免费的、类似 CAPTCHA 的垃圾信息防护功能，以保护数据隐私。','Enable Cloudflare Turnstile'=>'启用 Cloudflare Turnstile','Made with ♥ by the WPForms Team'=>'由 WPForms 团队倾情打造 ♥','Free Plugins'=>'免费插件','VIP Circle'=>'VIP 会员圈','Leading WordPress backup & site migration plugin. Over 1,500,000+ smart website owners use Duplicator to make reliable and secure WordPress backups to protect their websites. It also makes website migration really easy.'=>'领先的 WordPress 备份与网站迁移插件。超过 1,500,000+ 位精明的网站所有者使用 Duplicator 创建可靠且安全的 WordPress 备份，以保护他们的网站。它还让网站迁移变得非常简单。','Future proof your WordPress customizations with the most popular code snippet management plugin for WordPress. Trusted by over 1,500,000+ websites for easily adding code to WordPress right from the admin area.'=>'借助最受欢迎的 WordPress 代码片段管理插件，让您的 WordPress 自定义设置经得起未来考验。该插件已获得超过 1,500,000 个网站的信赖，可让您直接在管理后台轻松向 WordPress 添加代码。','WPCode'=>'WPCode','Top-rated WordPress donation and fundraising plugin. Over 10,000+ non-profit organizations and website owners use Charitable to create fundraising campaigns and raise more money online.'=>'广受好评的 WordPress 捐赠与筹款插件。已有超过 10,000 家非营利组织和网站所有者使用 Charitable 创建筹款活动，并在网上筹集更多资金。','Duplicator'=>'复制器','For more details on how Turnstile works, as well as a step by step setup guide, please check out our <a href="%s" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">documentation</a>.'=>'如需了解 Turnstile 的工作原理以及分步设置指南，请查阅我们的 <a href="%s" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">文档</a>。','Cloudflare Turnstile is a free, CAPTCHA-like service for preventing form spam while protecting data privacy. It offers a user-friendly experience by confirming visitors are real humans without requiring them to solve puzzles or math questions.'=>'Cloudflare Turnstile 是一项免费的、类似 CAPTCHA 的服务，旨在防止表单垃圾信息，同时保护数据隐私。它通过确认访问者是真实的人来提供友好的用户体验，而无需访问者解答谜题或数学题。','Light'=>'浅色','Auto'=>'自动','Dark'=>'深色','Basic Protection, reCAPTCHA, hCaptcha, Cloudflare Turnstile, Akismet, Country Filter, Keyword Filter, and Custom Captcha'=>'基本保护、reCAPTCHA、hCaptcha、Cloudflare Turnstile、Akismet、国家过滤、关键词过滤和自定义验证码','Basic Protection, reCAPTCHA, hCaptcha, Cloudflare Turnstile and Akismet'=>'基本防护、reCAPTCHA、hCaptcha、Cloudflare Turnstile 和 Akismet','You can\'t import forms because you don\'t have unfiltered HTML permissions. Please contact your site administrator or <a href="%s" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">reach out to our support team</a>.'=>'您无法导入表单，因为您没有“未过滤的 HTML”权限。请联系您的网站管理员，或<a href="%s" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">联系我们的支持团队</a>。','Sorry, we didn\'t find any matching icons.'=>'抱歉，我们没有找到任何匹配的图标。','Search 2000+ icons...'=>'搜索 2000 多个图标...','Browse or search for the perfect icon.'=>'浏览或搜索最合适的图标。','Icon Picker'=>'图标选择器','The icon library appears to be missing or damaged. It will now be reinstalled.'=>'图标库似乎丢失或损坏。系统将立即重新安装该图标库。','There was an error installing the icon library. Please try again later or <a href="%s" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer noopener">contact support</a> if the issue persists.'=>'安装图标库时出现错误。请稍后重试，或者<a href="%s" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer noopener">联系客服</a>（如果问题仍然存在）。','The icon library has been installed successfully. We will now save your form and reload the form builder.'=>'图标库已成功安装。现在我们将保存您的表单，并重新加载表单构建器。','This should only take a minute. Please don’t close or reload your browser window.'=>'这只需要一分钟。请不要关闭或刷新浏览器窗口。','Installing Icon Library'=>'安装图标库','In order to use the Icon Choices feature, an icon library must be downloaded and installed. It\'s quick and easy, and you\'ll only have to do this once.'=>'为了使用图标选择功能，必须下载并安装一个图标库。它又快又简单，而且你只需要做一次。','Uh oh!'=>'哎呀！','Done!'=>'完成！','Enter the email address or email address with recipient\'s name in "First Last %s" format.'=>'请输入电子邮件地址，或以“名 姓 %s”格式输入包含收件人姓名的电子邮件地址。','Select the style for the icon choices.'=>'选择图标选项的样式。','Icon Choice Style'=>'图标选择样式','Select icon size.'=>'选择图标大小。','Icon Size'=>'图标大小','Select an accent color for the icon choices.'=>'为图标选项选择一种点缀色。','Icon Color'=>'图标颜色','Enable this option to use icons with the choices.'=>'启用此选项可在选项旁显示图标。','Use Icon Choices'=>'使用图标选项','Entries are securely backed up in the cloud. Upgrade to restore.'=>'条目已在云端进行了安全备份。升级即可恢复。','Incorrect usage of this operation.'=>'此操作使用不当。','Update Preview'=>'更新预览','Collapse Editor'=>'折叠编辑器','Expand Editor'=>'展开编辑器','Visual'=>'可视化','Add Media'=>'添加媒体','Uploaded to this form'=>'上传到此表单','Integrate the powerful spam-fighting service trusted by millions of sites.'=>'集成这款深受数百万网站信赖的强大反垃圾邮件服务。','Add Google\'s free anti-spam service and choose between visible or invisible CAPTCHAs.'=>'添加谷歌免费反垃圾邮件服务，并在「可见验证码」与「隐形验证码」之间进行选择‌。','Add to Form'=>'添加到表单','Ask custom questions or require your visitor to answer a random math puzzle.'=>'提出自定义问题，或要求访客解答一道随机数学题。','Turn on free, privacy-oriented spam prevention that displays a visual CAPTCHA.'=>'启用免费、注重隐私的防垃圾内容功能，该功能将显示可视化验证码。','Block form entries that contain specific words or phrases that you define.'=>'屏蔽包含您所指定的特定单词或短语的条目。','Keyword Filter'=>'关键词过滤器','Stop spam at its source. Allow or deny entries from specific countries.'=>'从源头阻止垃圾信息。允许或拒绝来自特定国家的访问。','Country Filter'=>'国家筛选器','Get Started &rarr;'=>'开始使用 &rarr;','Automated tests that help to prevent bots from submitting your forms.'=>'有助于防止机器人提交表单的自动化测试。','Enable third-party CAPTCHAs to prevent form submissions from bots.'=>'启用第三方验证码，以防止机器人提交表单。','Enable File Upload Attachments'=>'启用文件上传附件功能','New Templates'=>'新模板','Favorite Templates'=>'收藏的模板','<h4>Add Text and Images to Your Form With Ease</h4> <p>To get started, replace this text with your own.</p>'=>'<h4>轻松在表单中添加文本和图片</h4> <p>开始使用时，请将此文本替换为您自己的内容。</p>','Text'=>'文本','Protection'=>'保护','Behind-the-scenes spam filtering that\'s invisible to your visitors.'=>'在后台自动过滤垃圾信息，访客完全不会察觉。','Turn on invisible spam protection.'=>'开启隐形垃圾邮件防护功能。','Error ID: %s.'=>'错误 ID：%s。','Your form has not been submitted because data is missing from the entry.'=>'由于表单中存在数据缺失，您的表单尚未提交。','Form data is not an array in `\\WPForms_Process::process()`. It might be caused by incorrect data returned by `wpforms_process_before_form_data` filter. Verify whether you have a custom code using this filter and debug value it is returning.'=>'在 `\\WPForms_Process::process()` 中，表单数据并非数组。这可能是由于 `wpforms_process_before_form_data` 过滤器返回的数据不正确所致。请确认您是否使用了该过滤器的自定义代码，并调试其返回的值。','Missing form data on form submission process %s'=>'表单提交过程中缺少表单数据 %s','Multi-page Forms, File Upload Forms, Multiple Form Notifications, File Upload and CSV Attachments, Conditional Form Confirmation, Save and Resume Form'=>'多页表单、文件上传表单、多表单通知、文件上传和 CSV 附件、条件表单确认、保存并继续填写表单','We recommend that you edit your forms on a bigger screen. If you\'d like to proceed, please understand that some functionality might not behave as expected.'=>'我们建议您在更大的屏幕上编辑表单。如果您仍要继续，请注意某些功能可能无法按预期运行。','Our form builder is optimized for desktop computers.'=>'我们的表单生成器针对台式电脑进行了优化。','File Upload Attachments'=>'文件上传附件','Also Available'=>'更多可用选项','Check the WPForms &raquo; Tools &raquo; <a href="%s">Logs</a> for more details.'=>'请查看 WPForms → “工具” → <a href="%s">日志</a> 以获取更多详细信息。','Multi-page Forms, File Upload Forms, Multiple Form Notifications, File Upload and CSV Attachments, Conditional Form Confirmation'=>'多页表单、文件上传表单、多表单通知、文件上传和 CSV 附件、条件表单确认','Additional Anti-Spam Settings'=>'其他反垃圾邮件设置','Basic Anti-Spam Settings'=>'基本的反垃圾邮件设置','Spam Protection and Security'=>'垃圾邮件防护与安全','Recommended'=>'推荐','Mark as Favorite'=>'标记为收藏','Remove from Favorites'=>'从收藏中移除','Entry CSV Attachment'=>'表单条目 CSV 附件','Enable Entry CSV Attachment'=>'启用表单条目 CSV 附件功能','Create Form'=>'创建表单','Available Templates'=>'可用模板','Sorry, we didn\'t find any templates that match your criteria.'=>'抱歉，我们没有找到符合您条件的模板。','Get a Head Start With Our Pre-Made Form Templates'=>'借助我们的现成表单模板，轻松起步','Layout'=>'布局','Never start from scratch again! While WPForms Lite allows you to create any type of form, you can save even more time with WPForms Pro. Upgrade to access hundreds more form templates and advanced form fields.'=>'再也不用从零开始！虽然 WPForms Lite 允许您创建任何类型的表单，但使用 WPForms Pro 还能为您节省更多时间。升级后，您将能够使用数百个额外的表单模板和高级表单字段。','Get Access to Our Library of %d+ Pre-Made Form Templates'=>'访问我们包含 %d+ 个现成表单模板的资源库','WPForms Templates'=>'WPForms 模板','After purchasing a license, just <strong>enter your license key on the WPForms Settings page</strong>. This will let your site automatically upgrade to %s! (Don\'t worry, all your forms and settings will be preserved.)'=>'购买许可证后，只需 <strong>在 WPForms 设置页面</strong>输入您的许可证密钥。这样您的网站就会自动升级到 %s！（请放心，您所有的表单和设置都会保留下来。）','Choose a template to speed up the process of creating your form. You can also start with a <a href="#" class="wpforms-trigger-blank">blank form</a> or <a href="%1$s" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">create your own</a>. <br>Have a suggestion for a new template? <a href="%2$s" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">We’d love to hear it</a>!'=>'选择一个模板，以加快表单的创建过程。您也可以从 <a href="#" class="wpforms-trigger-blank">空白表单</a> 开始，或者 <a href="%1$s" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">自行创建</a>。<br>有关于新模板的建议吗？<a href="%2$s" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">我们非常乐意听取您的意见</a>！','Please check out our <a href="%1$s" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">doc on fixing email delivery issues</a> for more details.'=>'请查阅我们的<a href="%1$s" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">关于解决电子邮件投递问题的文档</a>，了解更多详情。','This field is disabled in the editor mode.'=>'在编辑模式下，此字段处于禁用状态。','Dismiss'=>'忽略','You should enter a valid absolute address to the CTA Link field or leave it empty.'=>'您应该在 CTA 链接字段中输入有效的绝对地址，或者留空。','CTA is hidden if Expanded Content is used.'=>'如果使用扩展内容，CTA 将被隐藏。','Enter the URL for the form field call to action button. URL will be ignored if the field has extended description content: in that case button will be used to expand the description content.'=>'输入用于表单字段行动按钮的 URL。如果该字段包含扩展描述内容，则该 URL 将被忽略；此时，按钮将用于显示这些扩展描述内容。','CTA Link'=>'CTA 链接','Enter label for the form field call to action button. The label will be ignored if the field has extended description content: in that case button will be used to expand the description content.'=>'输入用于表单字段中行动按钮的标签。如果该字段有额外的描述内容，那么这个标签将被忽略；此时，按钮将用于显示这些描述内容。','The "Authorization Code" is required.'=>'需要输入“授权码”。','#%d (no name)'=>'#%d（无名称）','The "Account Nickname" is required.'=>'“账号昵称”为必填项。','Alternately, try using a From Address that matches your website domain (admin@%1$s).'=>'或者，尝试使用与您的网站域名相匹配的发件人地址（admin@%1$s）。','We strongly recommend that you install the free <a href="%1$s" target="_blank">WP Mail SMTP</a> plugin! The Setup Wizard makes it easy to fix your emails.'=>'我们强烈建议您安装免费的 <a href="%1$s" target="_blank">WP Mail SMTP</a> 插件！其设置向导可帮助您轻松解决邮件问题。','The current \'From Email\' address does not match your website domain name (%1$s). This can cause your notification emails to be blocked or marked as spam.'=>'当前的“发件人”邮箱地址与您的网站域名（%1$s）不符。这可能会导致您的通知邮件被拦截或被标记为垃圾邮件。','Anti-spam verification failed, please try again later.'=>'反垃圾邮件验证失败，请稍后再试。','PayPal Commerce'=>'PayPal Commerce','CTA Label'=>'CTA 标签','Adds an expandable content area below the description.'=>'在描述下方添加一个可展开的内容区域。','Enter text for the form field expanded description.'=>'请输入表单字段的展开说明文本。','Expanded Content'=>'展开内容','Enter text for the form field heading.'=>'请输入表单字段的标题文本。','Heading'=>'标题','This field is not editable'=>'此字段不可编辑','Internal Information'=>'内部信息','Please fill out the field in required format.'=>'请按规定格式填写该字段。','Accept payments using PayPal Commerce, Stripe, Square, PayPal Standard, and Authorize.Net'=>'支持通过 PayPal Commerce、Stripe、Square、PayPal Standard 和 Authorize.Net 接收付款','Accept payments using PayPal Commerce, Stripe, Square, and PayPal Standard'=>'通过 PayPal Commerce、Stripe、Square 和 PayPal Standard 接受付款','Custom'=>'自定义','Enable Akismet anti-spam protection'=>'启用 Akismet 反垃圾邮件保护','This feature cannot be used at this time because the Akismet plugin <a href="%1$s" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">has not been properly configured</a>. For information on how to use this feature, please <a href="%2$s" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">refer to our documentation</a>.'=>'目前无法使用此功能，因为 Akismet 插件 <a href="%1$s" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">尚未正确配置</a>。有关如何使用此功能的详细信息，请 <a href="%2$s" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">参阅我们的文档</a>。','This feature cannot be used at this time because the Akismet plugin <a href="%1$s" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">has not been activated</a>. For information on how to use this feature, please <a href="%2$s" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">refer to our documentation</a>.'=>'目前无法使用此功能，因为 Akismet 插件 <a href="%1$s" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">尚未激活</a>。有关如何使用此功能的详细信息，请 <a href="%2$s" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">参阅我们的文档</a>。','This feature cannot be used at this time because the Akismet plugin <a href="%1$s" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">has not been installed</a>. For information on how to use this feature, please <a href="%2$s" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">refer to our documentation</a>.'=>'目前无法使用此功能，因为 Akismet 插件 <a href="%1$s" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">尚未安装</a>。有关如何使用此功能的详细信息，请 <a href="%2$s" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">参阅我们的文档</a>。','Mapbox API'=>'Mapbox API','Collect the names, emails, and messages from site visitors that need to talk to you.'=>'收集需要与您联系的网站访问者的姓名、电子邮箱和留言。','The template you selected is currently not available, but you can try again later. If you continue to have trouble, please reach out to support.'=>'您选择的模板目前不可用，但您可以稍后再试。如果问题仍然存在，请联系客服。','Update'=>'更新','Unique Value'=>'唯一值','No such record.'=>'没有此类记录。','Record ID not found'=>'未找到记录 ID','Your form entries can’t be backed up because WPForms can’t connect to the backup server. If you’d like to back up your entries, find out how to <a href="%s" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">fix entry backup issues</a>.'=>'由于 WPForms 无法连接到备份服务器，因此无法备份您的表单条目。如果您想备份这些条目，请了解如何 <a href="%s" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">解决条目备份问题</a>。','Watch Video'=>'观看视频','You just hit 100 entries&hellip; and this is just the beginning! Now it’s time to dig into the data and figure out what makes your visitors tick. The User Journey addon shows you what your visitors looked at before submitting your form. Now you can easily find which areas of your site are triggering form conversions.'=>'您的表单提交量刚刚突破100条……而这仅仅是个开始！现在是时候深入分析数据，找出吸引访客的关键因素了。“用户旅程”插件会向您展示访客在提交表单前浏览了哪些内容。现在，您可以轻松找出网站上的哪些区域正在推动表单转化。','Congratulations! You Just Got Your 100th Form Entry!'=>'恭喜！您刚刚收到了第 100 份表单提交！','Share Your Idea'=>'分享您的想法','If you could add just one feature to WPForms, what would it be? We want to know! Our team is busy surveying valued customers like you as we plan the year ahead. We’d love to know which features would take your business to the next level! Do you have a second to share your idea with us?'=>'如果您只能为 WPForms 添加一项功能，您会选择什么？我们很想知道！在规划来年工作时，我们的团队正在积极征询像您这样的尊贵客户的意见。我们非常想了解哪些功能能帮助您的业务更上一层楼！您能花一点时间把您的想法告诉我们吗？','What’s Your Dream WPForms Feature?'=>'你最期待的 WPForms 功能是什么？','Get More Leads From Your Forms!'=>'通过表单获取更多潜在客户！','Want to Know What Your Customers Really Think?'=>'想知道您的客户真实想法吗？','Join Now'=>'立即加入','Running a WordPress site can be challenging. But help is just around the corner! Our Facebook group contains tons of tips and help to get your business growing! When you join our VIP Circle, you’ll get instant access to tips, tricks, and answers from a community of loyal WPForms users. Best of all, membership is 100% free!'=>'运营一个 WordPress 网站可能会面临不少挑战。但帮助就在眼前！我们的 Facebook 群组里汇集了海量的技巧和帮助，助您的业务蓬勃发展！加入我们的 VIP 圈后，您将立即获得来自忠实 WPForms 用户社区的技巧、诀窍和解答。最棒的是，会员资格完全免费！','Are your forms converting fewer visitors than you hoped? Often, visitors quit forms partway through. That can prevent you from getting all the leads you deserve to capture. With our Form Abandonment addon, you can capture partial entries even if your visitor didn’t hit Submit! From there, it’s easy to follow up with leads and turn them into loyal customers.'=>'您的表单将访客转化为客户的效率是否低于预期？通常情况下，访客会在填写表单的过程中中途放弃。这可能会导致您无法获取本应捕获的所有潜在客户。借助我们的“表单放弃”插件，即使访客未点击“提交”按钮，您也能捕获部分已填写的内容！在此基础上，您可以轻松跟进潜在客户，并将其转化为忠实客户。','Nothing beats real feedback from your customers and visitors. That’s why many small businesses love our awesome Surveys and Polls addon. Instantly unlock full survey reporting right in your WordPress dashboard. And don’t forget: building a survey is easy with our pre-made templates, so you could get started within a few minutes!'=>'没有什么比来自客户和访客的真实反馈更宝贵了。正因如此，许多中小企业都青睐我们这款出色的“调查与投票”插件。您可以在 WordPress 仪表盘中立即解锁完整的调查报告功能。别忘了：借助我们的现成模板，创建调查非常简单，您只需几分钟就能开始！','Want to Be a VIP? Join Now!'=>'想成为 VIP 吗？立即加入！','Did you know that many WordPress sites are not properly configured to send emails? With the free WP Mail SMTP plugin, you can easily optimize your site to send emails, avoid the spam folder, and make sure your emails land in the recipient’s inbox every time.'=>'你知道吗？许多 WordPress 网站在发送邮件方面的配置并不正确。借助免费的 WP Mail SMTP 插件，你可以轻松优化网站以发送邮件，避免邮件被归入垃圾邮件文件夹，并确保你的邮件每次都能送达收件人的收件箱。','Don’t Miss Your Form Notification Emails!'=>'千万别错过表单通知邮件！','Read the Guide'=>'阅读指南','Start Building'=>'开始构建','We’re grateful that you chose WPForms for your website! Now that you’ve installed the plugin, you’re less than 5 minutes away from publishing your first form. To make it easy, we’ve got %s form templates to get you started!'=>'非常感谢您选择 WPForms 作为您网站的表单插件！现在您已经安装好了该插件，距离发布您的第一个表单只需不到 5 分钟。为了让您更轻松地上手，我们准备了 %s 个表单模板供您参考！','Welcome to WPForms!'=>'欢迎使用 WPForms！','Edit Tags'=>'编辑标签','Filter'=>'筛选','No tags to choose from'=>'没有可选的标签','No forms selected when trying to add a tag to them.'=>'尝试为其添加标签时，未选择任何表单。','Most likely, your session expired. Please reload the page.'=>'很可能是您的会话已过期。请刷新页面。','Türkiye'=>'土耳其','We’ve detected the same text in your allowlist and denylist. To prevent a conflict, we’ve removed the following text from the list you’re currently viewing:'=>'我们发现您的允许列表和拒绝列表中存在相同的文本。为避免冲突，我们已从您当前查看的列表中删除了以下文本：','You have <strong>1 tag</strong> selected for deletion.'=>'您已选中 <strong>1 个标签</strong> 待删除。','Delete Tags'=>'删除标签','Delete tags that you\'re no longer using. Deleting a tag will remove it from a form, but will not delete the form itself.'=>'删除不再使用的标签。删除标签会将其从表单中移除，但不会删除表单本身。','Manage Tags'=>'管理标签','<strong>%d forms</strong> selected for Bulk Edit.'=>'<strong>%d 个表单</strong> 已被选中进行批量编辑。','<strong>1 form</strong> selected for Bulk Edit.'=>'<strong>1 个表单</strong> 已被选中进行批量编辑。','All Tags'=>'所有标签','Save changes'=>'保存更改',', '=>', ','Refresh'=>'刷新','In order to update the tags in the forms list, please refresh the page.'=>'要更新表单列表中的标签，请刷新页面。','Almost done!'=>'快完成了！','1 tag was successfully deleted.'=>'已成功删除 1 个标签。','There are no tags to delete.<br>Please create at least one by adding it to any form.'=>'没有要删除的标签。<br>请通过将其添加到任何表单中来创建至少一个标签。','You have <strong>%d tags</strong> selected for deletion.'=>'您已选中 <strong>%d 个标签</strong> 准备删除。','How to use Prefill by URL'=>'如何使用 URL 预填充功能','Enable Prefill by URL'=>'启用 URL 预填充功能','Mark form with the tags. To create a new tag, simply type it and press Enter.'=>'使用标签对表单进行标记。要创建新标签，只需输入标签名称并按回车键即可。','Tags'=>'标签','Press Enter or "," key to add new tag'=>'按 Enter 键或“,”键添加新标签','Enter a %s nickname'=>'请输入 %s 昵称','Save Changes'=>'保存更改','WordPress'=>'WordPress','Color Scheme'=>'配色方案','Line'=>'线条','Bar'=>'条形图','Graph Style'=>'图表样式','<strong>Your form entries are not being stored in WordPress, and your entry backups are not active.</strong> If there\'s a problem with deliverability, you\'ll lose form entries. We recommend that you enable Entry Backups, especially if you\'re considering <a href="%s" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="wpforms-upgrade-modal">upgrading to WPForms PRO</a>.'=>'<strong>您的表单提交数据未存储在 WordPress 中，且表单备份功能未启用。</strong> 如果出现发送问题，您将丢失表单提交数据。我们建议您启用“表单提交备份”功能，特别是如果您正在考虑<a href="%s" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="wpforms-upgrade-modal">升级到 WPForms PRO</a>。','<strong>Your form entries are not being stored locally, but are backed up remotely.</strong> If you <a href="%s" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="wpforms-upgrade-modal">upgrade to WPForms PRO</a>, you can restore your entries and they’ll be available in the WordPress dashboard. Entry backups expire after 1 year.'=>'<strong>您的表单提交数据不会保存在本地，而是会进行远程备份。</strong> 如果您 <a href="%s" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="wpforms-upgrade-modal">升级到 WPForms PRO</a>，即可恢复这些提交数据，它们将显示在 WordPress 仪表盘中。提交数据的备份将在 1 年后过期。','Lite Connect'=>'Lite Connect','Enable Form Entry Backups for Free'=>'免费启用表单输入备份功能','Enable Form Entry Backups'=>'启用表单条目备份','Unfortunately, the error occurs while updating Form Entry Backups setting. Please try again later.'=>'很遗憾，更新表单条目备份设置时出错。请稍后再试。','Form Entry Backups were successfully disabled.'=>'表单条目备份已成功禁用。','Entry Backups Disabled'=>'已禁用条目备份','Awesome! If you decide to upgrade to WPForms Pro, you can restore your entries and will have instant access to reports.'=>'太棒了！如果您决定升级到 WPForms Pro，您可以恢复您的表单提交数据，并能立即查看报告。','Entry Backups Enabled'=>'已启用条目备份','%d entry backed up'=>'已备份 %d 条记录','Entries Backups Are Enabled'=>'已启用条目备份','Enable Entry Backups'=>'启用条目备份','Entries are available through email notifications. If you enable Entry Backups, you can restore them once you upgrade to WPForms Pro.'=>'表单条目可通过电子邮件通知获取。若启用「表单条目备份」功能，在升级至 WPForms Pro 版本后，即可恢复这些条目。','Entries are not stored in WPForms Lite'=>'WPForms Lite 中不会存储表单提交数据','This is the Lite Connect endpoint page.'=>'这是 Lite Connect 端点页面。','This is a preview of the latest saved revision of your form. If this preview does not match your form, save your changes and then refresh this page. This form preview is not publicly accessible.'=>'这是您表单最新保存版本的预览。如果此预览与您的表单不符，请保存更改，然后刷新此页面。此表单预览不对外公开。','(no title)'=>'（无标题）','Site editor template'=>'站点编辑器模板','Inactive widgets'=>'未启用的小工具','Form Locations'=>'表单位置','View form locations'=>'查看表单位置','Form locations'=>'表单位置','Block Widget'=>'区块小工具','Text Widget'=>'文本小工具','No Thanks'=>'不用了，谢谢','since %s'=>'自 %s 以来','WPForms Widget'=>'WPForms 小工具','Last %d day'=>'过去 %d 天','Select timespan'=>'选择时间范围','Help Docs'=>'帮助文档','Upgrade to WPForms Pro & Restore Form Entries'=>'升级至 WPForms Pro 并恢复表单提交数据','since you enabled Lite Connect on %s'=>'自从您在 %s 上启用了 Lite Connect 以来','%d entry has been backed up'=>'已备份 %d 条记录','Disable Entry Backups'=>'禁用条目备份','If you disable Lite Connect, you will no longer be able to restore your entries when you upgrade to WPForms Pro.'=>'如果您禁用了 Lite Connect，那么在升级到 WPForms Pro 时，将无法恢复您的表单条目。','Are you sure?'=>'你确定吗？','Security & Protection'=>'安全与保护','Security and Protection.'=>'安全与保护。','Form Entry Backups'=>'表单条目备份','Easily restore your entries when you upgrade to WPForms Pro.'=>'升级到 WPForms Pro 后，可轻松恢复您的表单数据。','Restore Form Entries'=>'恢复表单条目','Form Entry Backups Are Enabled'=>'表单条目备份已启用','WPForms now offers offsite backups for your form entries. If you decide to upgrade to WPForms Pro, you can restore entries collected while you used WPForms Lite.'=>'WPForms 现已提供表单条目的异地备份功能。如果您决定升级到 WPForms Pro，即可恢复在使用 WPForms Lite 期间收集的表单条目。','One More Thing'=>'还有一件事','Read the documentation'=>'阅读文档','Get WPForms Pro'=>'获取 WPForms Pro','Connecting...'=>'正在连接...','By enabling Lite Connect you agree to our <a href="%s" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Terms of Service</a> and to share your information with WPForms.'=>'启用 Lite Connect 即表示您同意我们的 <a href="%s" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">服务条款</a>，并同意与 WPForms 共享您的信息。','Ready to grow your website? Get the latest pro tips and updates from the WPForms team.'=>'准备好让您的网站更上一层楼了吗？获取来自 WPForms 团队的最新专业技巧和更新。','WPForms Newsletter'=>'WPForms 电子报','WPForms Newsletter.'=>'WPForms 电子报。','When you upgrade to WPForms Pro, we\'ll automatically restore all of the entries that you collected in WPForms Lite.'=>'当您升级到 WPForms Pro 时，我们会自动恢复您在 WPForms Lite 中收集的所有表单提交数据。','Backup & Restore'=>'备份与恢复','Backup and Restore.'=>'备份与恢复','Entries are stored securely and privately until you\'re ready to upgrade. Our team cannot view your forms or entries.'=>'提交的信息将以安全且私密的方式存储，直到您准备好升级为止。我们的团队无法查看您的表单或提交内容。','Revisions are enabled, but they’re limited to %d. You can increase this by making a simple change to your WordPress configuration.'=>'修订功能已启用，但数量限制为 %d。您只需对 WordPress 配置进行简单修改，即可增加此限制。','Form Revisions Are Limited'=>'表单修改次数有限','Learn How'=>'了解如何操作','It appears that revisions are disabled on your WordPress installation. You can enable revisions for WPForms while leaving posts revisions disabled.'=>'看来您的 WordPress 安装中已禁用修订功能。您可以为 WPForms 启用修订功能，同时保持文章修订功能处于禁用状态。','Form Revisions Are Disabled'=>'表单修订功能已禁用','Unknown user'=>'未知用户','by %s'=>'作者：%s','Current Version'=>'当前版本','Back to All Forms'=>'返回所有表单','Here\'s how it works.'=>'其工作原理如下。','You\'ve Already Started - Here\'s the Next Step (It\'s Easy)'=>'你已经起步了 - 接下来是下一步（操作很简单）','Constant Contact'=>'Constant Contact','You’re about to save a form revision. Continuing will make this the current version.'=>'您即将保存表单的修订版本。继续操作将使此版本成为当前版本。','%s ago'=>'%s 前','Empty Trash'=>'清空回收站','Found <strong>%1$d form</strong> in <em>the trash</em> containing <em>"%2$s"</em>'=>'在包含 <em>"%2$s"</em> 的 <em> 回收站 </em> 中找到了 <strong>%1$d表格 </strong>','%1$s at %2$s'=>'%1$s %2$s','Move this form to trash'=>'将此表单移至回收站','All'=>'所有','%1$d template was successfully permanently deleted.'=>'%1$d 模板已成功永久删除。','%1$d template was successfully moved to Trash.'=>'模板 %1$d 已