即<a href="%s">检查您的表单</a>。','Are you sure you want to delete this form and all its entries?'=>'您确定要删除此表单及其所有条目吗？','Could not install the plugin. Please download and install it manually.'=>'无法安装该插件。请手动下载并安装。','Address, Phone, Website / URL, Date / Time, Password, File Upload, Layout, Rich Text, Content, HTML, Pagebreaks, Entry Preview, Section Dividers, Ratings, and Hidden Field'=>'地址、电话、网站/ URL、日期/时间、密码、文件上传、版面布局、富文本、内容、HTML、分页符、条目预览、分区分隔符、评分和隐藏字段','The leading WordPress analytics plugin that shows you how people find and use your website, so you can make data driven decisions to grow your business. Properly set up Google Analytics without writing code.'=>'领先的WordPress分析插件，可向您显示人们如何查找和使用您的网站，以便您制定以数据为依据的决策来发展您的业务。无需编写代码即可正确设置Google Analytics（分析）。','AIOSEO'=>'AIOSEO','The original WordPress SEO plugin and toolkit that improves your website\'s search rankings. Comes with all the SEO features like Local SEO, WooCommerce SEO, sitemaps, SEO optimizer, schema, and more.'=>'原创的WordPress SEO插件和工具包，提高您网站的搜索排名。附带了大量的SEO功能，如本地SEO，WooCommerce SEO，站点地图，SEO优化程序等。','AIOSEO Pro'=>'AIOSEO Pro','SeedProd'=>'SeedProd','SeedProd Pro'=>'SeedProd Pro','PushEngage'=>'PushEngage','Turn your website visitors into brand ambassadors! Easily grow your email list, website traffic, and social media followers with the most powerful giveaways & contests plugin for WordPress.'=>'将您的网站访客转变为品牌大使! 使用 强大的 WordPress 赠品和竞赛插件，轻松增加您的电子邮件列表、网站流量和社交媒体粉丝。','Smash Balloon Instagram Feeds'=>'Smash Balloon Instagram Feeds','Smash Balloon Instagram Feeds Pro'=>'Smash Balloon Instagram Feeds Pro','Smash Balloon Facebook Feeds'=>'Smash Balloon Facebook Feeds','Easily display Instagram content on your WordPress site without writing any code. Comes with multiple templates, ability to show content from multiple accounts, hashtags, and more. Trusted by 1 million websites.'=>'轻松在您的 WordPress 站点上嵌入 Instagram 内容，无需编码。配有多个模板，能够显示来自多个账户的内容、标签等。受到 100万个网站的信赖。','The fastest drag & drop landing page builder for WordPress. Create custom landing pages without writing code, connect them with your CRM, collect subscribers, and grow your audience. Trusted by 1 million sites.'=>'为 WordPress 打造的超快速拖拽式着陆页面构建器。无需编写代码即可创建自定义着陆页，将 SeedProd 与您的客户关系管理系统（CRM）相连接，收纳订阅者并增加您的受众。受到 100万个网站的信赖。','Connect with your visitors after they leave your website with the leading web push notification software. Over 10,000+ businesses worldwide use PushEngage to send 15 billion notifications each month.'=>'借助业界领先的网页推送通知软件，在访客离开您的网站后继续与他们保持联系。全球已有超过 10,000 家企业使用 PushEngage，每月发送 150 亿条通知。','Improve your WordPress email deliverability and make sure that your website emails reach user\'s inbox with the #1 SMTP plugin for WordPress. Over 3 million websites use it to fix WordPress email issues.'=>'借助 WordPress 排名第一的 SMTP 插件，提升您的 WordPress 邮件送达率，确保网站邮件能顺利送达用户的收件箱。已有超过 300 万个网站使用该插件解决了 WordPress 邮件问题。','Instantly get more subscribers, leads, and sales with the #1 conversion optimization toolkit. Create high converting popups, announcement bars, spin a wheel, and more with smart targeting and personalization.'=>'使用排名第一的转化优化工具包，立即得到更多的订阅者、潜在客户和销售额。通过智能定位和个性化功能，创建高转化率的弹出窗口、公告栏、幻灯片等。','Do you want to learn more about visitors who fill out your online forms? Our geolocation addon allows you to collect and store your website visitors geolocation data along with their form submission. This insight can help you to be better informed and turn more leads into customers. Furthermore, add a smart address field that autocompletes using the Google Places API.'=>'您想更深入地了解填写您在线表单的访客吗？我们的地理位置插件可让您在访客提交表单时，同步收集并存储其地理位置数据。这些洞察有助于您更全面地掌握情况，并将更多潜在客户转化为实际客户。此外，您还可以添加一个利用 Google Places API 实现自动补全功能的智能地址输入框。','Location Info in Entries'=>'条目中的位置信息','Address Autocomplete Field'=>'地址自动填充字段','Smart Address Field'=>'智能地址字段','City'=>'市','Country'=>'国家/地区','Postal/Zip Code'=>'邮地/邮编','Latitude/Longitude'=>'纬度/经度','Embedded Map in Forms'=>'表单中嵌入的地图','Google Places API'=>'Google Places API','Install & Activate'=>'安装并启用','Survey Results'=>'调查结果','Form ID: %d'=>'表单ID:%d','No Label'=>'无标签','N/A'=>'N/A','This setting is disabled because you have the "Force From Name" setting enabled in the <a href="%s" target="_blank">WP Mail SMTP</a> plugin.'=>'此设置被禁用，因为您在<a href="%s" target="_blank">WP MAIL SMTP</a>插件的设置中启用了"强制发件人名称"。','This setting is disabled because you have the "Force From Email" setting enabled in the <a href="%s" target="_blank">WP Mail SMTP</a> plugin.'=>'此设置被禁用，因为您在<a href="%s" target="_blank">WP MAIL SMTP</a>插件的设置中启用了"强制发件人地址"。','Bonaire, Saint Eustatius and Saba'=>'北京、上海和深圳。','It seems you don\'t have any payment addons activated. Click one of the available addons and start accepting payments today!'=>'您似乎没有启用任何支付扩展。单击其中一个可用的扩展并立即开始接受付款！','Number Positive'=>'正数','To edit the License Key, please first click the Remove Key button. Please note that removing this key will remove access to updates, addons, and support.'=>'要编辑许可证密钥，请先点击“删除密钥”按钮。请注意，删除该密钥后，您将无法再获取更新、附加组件和技术支持。','Locations'=>'地点','Powerful location-based insights and features…'=>'强大的基于地理位置的洞察与功能……','Address Autocomplete'=>'地址自动填充','Enable Address Autocomplete'=>'启用地址自动填充','You are not allowed to install plugins.'=>'您無權安裝插件。','WPForms Pro is installed but not activated.'=>'WPForms Pro已安装但未启用。','There was an error while installing an upgrade. Please download the plugin from wpforms.com and install it manually.'=>'安装升级时出错。请从wpforms.com下载插件并手动安装。','We\'re sorry, Address Autocomplete is part of the Geolocation Addon and not available on your plan. Please upgrade to the PRO plan to unlock all these awesome features.'=>'很抱歉，地址自动填充功能是地理位置扩展的一部分，您当前的套餐不支持此功能。请升级到pro套餐以解锁所有强大功能。','Heads up! WPForms has detected an issue with JavaScript on this page. JavaScript is required for this form to work properly, so this form may not work as expected. See our <a href="%s" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">troubleshooting guide</a> to learn more or contact support.'=>'注意! WPForms检测到此页面的JavaScript存在问题。此表单需要JavaScript才能正常运作，此表单可能无法按预期运作。请参阅我们的<a href="%s" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">故障排除指南</a>以了解更多信息或联系支持。','This message is only displayed to site administrators.'=>'此消息只会显示给站点管理员。','Please save settings to generate a preview of your CAPTCHA here.'=>'请保存设置以在此生成验证码预览。','This CAPTCHA is generated using your site and secret keys. If an error is displayed, please double-check your keys.'=>'此验证码是由您的站点和密匙生成的。如果显示错误，请仔细检查您的密钥。','A preview of your CAPTCHA is displayed below. Please view to verify the CAPTCHA settings are correct.'=>'下面将显示验证码的预览。请查看以确认验证码设置是否正确。','hCaptcha is a free and privacy-oriented spam prevention service. Within your forms, hCaptcha will display a checkbox asking users to prove they\'re human (much like Google\'s v2 Checkbox reCAPTCHA). This is a simple step for legitimate site visitors, but is extremely effective at blocking spam.'=>'hCaptcha是一个免费的、以隐私为主的垃圾信息防护服务。hCaptcha将会在您的表单中显示一个复选框，要求用户确认自己是人类（很像Google reCAPTCHA v2的复选框）。这对合法的访问者来说是一个简单的步骤，但在阻止垃圾信息方面却非常有效。','For more details on how hCaptcha works, as well as a step by step setup guide, please check out our <a href="%s" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">documentation</a>.'=>'有关hCaptcha的运作方式及各步骤的设置指南的详细信息，请查看我们的<a href="%s" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">文档</a>。','Your session expired. Please reload the page.'=>'您的会话已过期。请重新加载页面。','Missing data.'=>'数据缺失。','Connection missing.'=>'连接丢失。','CAPTCHA'=>'验证码','Custom Captcha'=>'自定义验证码','Are you sure you want to disable %s for this form?'=>'您确定要禁用此表单的%s验证码吗？','hCaptcha verification failed, please try again later.'=>'hCaptcha验证失败，请稍后再试。','Character Limit'=>'字符限制','Word Limit'=>'字数限制','%s verification failed, please try again later.'=>'%s验证失败，请稍后再试。','Google reCAPTCHA v2'=>'Google reCAPTCHA v2','Kosovo'=>'Kosovo','Eswatini (Kingdom of)'=>'Eswatini (Kingdom of)','Vietnam'=>'Vietnam','Disabling entry storage for this form will completely prevent any new submissions from getting saved to your site. If you still intend to keep a record of entries through notification emails, then please <a href="%s" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">test your form</a> to ensure emails are sent reliably.'=>'禁用此表单的提交数据存储功能后，将完全阻止任何新提交的数据被保存到您的网站上。如果您仍希望通过通知邮件保留提交记录，请<a href="%s" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">测试您的表单</a>，以确保邮件能够可靠地发送出去。','Enable hCaptcha'=>'启用验证码','PDF, Calculations, Form Abandonment, Conversational Forms, Lead Forms, Frontend Post Submission, User Registration, Geolocation, Google Sheets, Coupons, Dropbox, Google Calendar, Google Drive, Airtable, Notion, and more (%1$s+ total)'=>'PDF、计算、表单放弃、对话式表单、潜在客户表单、前端表单提交、用户注册、地理位置、Google 表格、优惠券、Dropbox、Google 日历、Google 云端硬盘、Airtable、Notion 等（共计 %1$s+ 项）','PDF, Calculations, Form Abandonment, Conversational Forms, Lead Forms, Frontend Post Submission, User Registration, Geolocation, Webhooks, Google Sheets, Coupons, Dropbox, Google Calendar, Google Drive, Entry Automation, Airtable, Notion, and more (%1$s+ total)'=>'PDF、计算、表单放弃、对话式表单、潜在客户表单、前端表单提交、用户注册、地理位置、Webhook、Google 表格、优惠券、Dropbox、Google 日历、Google 云端硬盘、表单提交自动化、Airtable、Notion 等（共计 %1$s+ 项）','Could not disconnect this account.'=>'无法断开此帐户的连接。','For details, including how this looks and works for your site\'s visitors, please check out <a href="%s" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">our doc</a>.'=>'有关详细信息（包括该功能在您网站访客端的外观和运作方式），请参阅 <a href="%s" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">我们的文档</a>。','Ask a question or search the docs...'=>'提出问题或搜索文档... ...','Clear'=>'清除','No docs found'=>'未找到文档','View Documentation'=>'查看文档','Browse documentation, reference material, and tutorials for WPForms.'=>'浏览WPForms的文档、参考资料和教程。','View All Documentation'=>'查看所有文档','Get Support'=>'获得支持','Submit a ticket and our world class support team will be in touch soon.'=>'提交一张工单，我们的世界级支持团队将很快与您联系。','Submit a Support Ticket'=>'提交支持工单','Upgrade to WPForms Pro to access our world class customer support.'=>'升级到WPForms Pro以获得我们的世界级客户支持。','View All'=>'查看全部','Docs'=>'文档','Unfortunately the error occurred while downloading help data.'=>'抱歉，下载帮助数据时发生错误。','This email address is