re.'=>'使用代码自定义和扩展WPForms。我们全面的开发人员资源包括有关核心操作、过滤器、函数等的教程，摘要和文档。','Community'=>'社区','Check this option to limit text length by characters or words count.'=>'选中此选项可按字符或字数限制文本长度。','Characters'=>'字符','Do you have an idea or suggestion for WPForms? If you have thoughts on features, integrations, addons, or improvements - we want to hear it! We appreciate all feedback and insight from our users.'=>'您对WPForms有什么想法或建议吗？如果您有关于功能、集成、扩展或改进方面的想法或建议--我们希望听到您的想法和意见！我们感谢所有来自用户的反馈和见解。','WPForms VIP Circle Facebook Group'=>'WPForms VIP Circle Facebook 群组','WPBeginner Engage Facebook Group'=>'WPBeginner Engage Facebook 群组','Suggest a Feature'=>'建议新增功能','Version'=>'版本','Total submissions (since v1.5.0)'=>'提交总数（自 v1.5.0 起）','Total forms'=>'全部表单','Pro install date'=>'专业版安装日期','Please enter your license key to connect.'=>'请输入您的许可证密钥进行连接。','Not found'=>'未找到','No key provided.'=>'未提供授权码。','Lite install date'=>'精简版安装日期','DB tables'=>'数据库表','WP Mail SMTP Pro'=>'WP Mail SMTP Pro','Activate Now'=>'立即激活','You cannot send emails with WPForms\\Emails\\Mailer until init/admin_init has been reached.'=>'在到达 init/admin_init 之前，您不能使用 WPForms\\Emails\\Mailer 发送电子邮件。','Weekly WPForms Email Summaries'=>'每周 WPForms 电子邮件摘要','View Email Summary Example'=>'查看电子邮件摘要示例','There was an error installing WPForms Pro. Please try again.'=>'安装WPForms专业版时出错。请再试一遍。','Disable Email Summaries weekly delivery.'=>'禁用电子邮件摘要每周传递。','Disable Email Summaries'=>'禁用电子邮件摘要','There was an error while installing an upgrade. Please check file system permissions and try again. Also, you can download the plugin from wpforms.com and install it manually.'=>'安装升级时出现错误。请检查文件系统权限后再试。另外，你也可以从wpforms.com下载插件，然后手动安装。','Only the Lite version can be upgraded.'=>'仅基本版可以升级。','Pro version installed but needs to be activated on the Plugins page inside your WordPress admin.'=>'专业版已安装，但需要在WordPress仪表盘内的插件页面启用。','You do not have permission to install plugins.'=>'您没有安装插件的权限。','The WPForms Team'=>'WPForms 团队','Paste license key here'=>'在此处粘贴许可证密钥','Oops!'