 features.'=>'通过升级到Pro并解锁所有强大功能，充分利用WPForms。','Deactivate'=>'停用','Could not authenticate with the provider.'=>'无法与提供商进行身份验证。','Basic Form Templates'=>'基本表单模板','Are you sure you want to duplicate this form?'=>'您确定要复制此表单吗？','All Advanced Features'=>'所有高级功能','A Complete Guide to WPForms Settings'=>'WPForms设置的完整指南','Shortcode'=>'短代码','Tanzania (United Republic of)'=>'坦桑尼亚联合共和国','Add New'=>'新增','Install Addon'=>'安装扩展','Searching Addons'=>'搜索扩展','Addons'=>'扩展','Addon installed.'=>'扩展已安装。','Addon installed & activated.'=>'扩展安装并启用成功。','Addon deactivated.'=>'扩展已禁用。','Could not deactivate the addon. Please deactivate from the Plugins page.'=>'无法禁用扩展。 请从“插件”页面禁用。','Email Marketing Addons included'=>'包括电子邮件营销扩展','How to Install and Activate WPForms Addons'=>'如何安装和启用 WPForms扩展','It seems you do not have any payment addons activated. You can head over to the <a href="%s">Addons page</a> to install and activate the addon for your payment service.'=>'您似乎没有启用任何支付服务扩展。您可以前往<a href="%s">扩展页面</a>为您的支付服务安装和启用扩展。','It seems you do not have any marketing addons activated. You can head over to the <a href="%s">Addons page</a> to install and activate the addon for your provider.'=>'您似乎没有启用任何营销服务扩展。您可以前往<a href="%s">扩展页面</a>安装并启用扩展。','No Addons Included'=>'不包含扩展','Would you like to access WPForms addons to extend the functionality of your forms? The first thing you need to do is install WPForms. Once that’s done, let’s go ahead and look at the process of activating addons.'=>'您想访问WPForms扩展来增强您的表单功能吗？您需要做的第一件事就是安装WPForms。完成后，让我们继续看看启用扩展的过程。','View all your leads in one place to streamline your workflow.'=>'在一处查看您的所有结果，以简化您的工作流程。','In the Forms Overview page, the forms list will be empty because there are no forms yet. To create a new form, click on the Add New button, and this will launch the WPForms Form Builder.'=>'在“表单概述”页面中，表单列表将为空，因为还没有表单。 要创建新表单，请单击“添加新”按钮，这将启动WPForms表单构建器。','High-Converting Form Builder'=>'高转换率的表单构建器','Thank you for choosing WPForms - the most powerful drag & drop WordPress form builder in the market.'=>'感谢您选择WPForms--市面上最强大的拖拽式WordPress表单构建器。','Would you like to learn more about all of the settings available in WPForms? In addition to tons of customization options within the form builder, WPForms has an extensive list of plugin-wide options available. This includes choosing your currency, adding GDPR enhancements, setting up integrations.'=>'您想了解更多WPForms中所有可用的设置吗？除了在表单构建器内的大量自定义选项外，WPForms还提供了很多可供插件使用的选项。包括选择货币，添加GDPR增强功能，设置集成。','Thanks for being a loyal WPForms Lite user. <strong>Upgrade to WPForms Pro</strong> to unlock all the awesome features and experience<br>why WPForms is consistently rated the best WordPress form builder.'=>'感谢您成为忠实的WPForms Lite用户。 <strong>升级到WPForms Pro </strong>以解锁所有强大的功能和体验<br>为什么WPForms一直被评为最佳WordPress表单构建器。','WPForms is both easy to use and extremely powerful. We have tons of helpful features that allow us to give you everything you need from a form builder.'=>'WPForms既易于使用又非常强大。我们有很多实用的功能，可为您提供表单生成器所需的一切。','Save Settings'=>'保存设置','We made the form creation process extremely intuitive, so you can create a form to start capturing emails within 5 minutes or less.'=>'我们将表单创建过程变得直观，让您可以在5分钟或更短的时间内创建一个表单并开始收集内容。','As a business owner, time is my most valuable asset. WPForms allow me to create smart online forms with just a few clicks. With their pre-built form templates and the drag & drop builder, I can create a new form that works in less than 2 minutes without writing a single line of code. Well worth the investment.'=>'作为一名企业主，时间是我最宝贵的资产。WPForms让我只需单机几下就可创建人性化的在线表单。通过其预制的表单模板和拖拽式创建工具，我可以快速的在2分钟内创建一个新的表单而无需编写一行代码。非常值得投资。','Easily create high performance forms with our smart conditional logic.'=>'使用我们的人性化条件逻辑轻松创建高性能表单。','Here are 3 big reasons why every smart business in the world has an email list:'=>'以下是世界上每个聪明的企业都拥有电子邮件列表的3个重要原因。','Powerful Form Logic for Building Smart Forms'=>'用于构建人性化表单的强大表单逻辑','Spam Protection'=>'垃圾内容防护','reCAPTCHA is a free anti-spam service from Google which helps to protect your website from spam and abuse while letting real people pass through with ease.'=>'reCAPTCHA是谷歌提供的一项免费反垃圾服务，可帮助您的网站防护垃圾内容和滥用，同时让真人轻松通过。','Are you sure you want to delete this choice?'=>'您确定要删除此选择吗？','Due to form changes, conditional logic rules will be removed or updated:'=>'由于表单更改，条件逻辑规则将被删除或更新。','WPForms Builder'=>'WPForms 构建器','Hello and welcome to WPForms, the most beginner friendly drag & drop WordPress forms plugin. At WPForms, we build software that helps you create beautiful responsive online forms for your website in minutes.'=>'您好，欢迎使用 WPForms，这是最适合初学者的拖拽式 WordPress 表单插件。在 WPForms，我们构建的软件可以帮助您在几分钟内创建漂亮的响应式在线表单。','Thanks for your interest in WPForms Pro!'=>'感谢您对 WPForms Pro 的关注！','<strong>Please Note:</strong> Support for PHP 7.3 and below will be discontinued soon. After this, if no further action is taken, WPForms functionality will be disabled.'=>'<strong>请注意：</strong> 对 PHP 7.3 及以下版本的支持即将终止。此后，若未采取进一步措施，WPForms 的功能将被禁用。','Our smart captcha and spam protection automatically prevents spam submissions.'=>'我们的智能验证码和垃圾信息防护功能会自动阻止垃圾信息提交。','WPForms makes it easy to create forms in WordPress. You can watch the video tutorial or read our guide on how to create your first form.'=>'WPForms 让您能够轻松地在 WordPress 中创建表单。您可以观看视频教程，或阅读我们的指南，了解如何创建您的第一个表单。','Could not activate the addon. Please activate it on the Plugins page.'=>'无法激活该插件。请在“插件”页面上将其激活。','No Form ID Provided'=>'未提供表单 ID','Error Creating Form'=>'创建表单时出错','No Form Name Provided'=>'未提供表单名称','Add New Group'=>'添加新群组','The %1$s %2$s contains over %3$s items (%4$s). This may make the field difficult for your visitors to use and/or cause the form to be slow.'=>'%1$s %2$s 中包含超过 %3$s 个项目（%4$s）。这可能会导致访客难以使用该字段，并/或导致表单响应缓慢。','Please rate %1$s <a href="%2$s" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;</a> on <a href="%3$s" target="_blank" rel="noopener">WordPress.org</a> to help us spread the word.'=>'请为 %1$s 评分 <a href="%2$s" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;&#9733; </a> 在 <a href="%3$s" target="_blank" rel="noopener">WordPress.org</a> 上，以帮助我们传播这一消息。','%1$d template was successfully duplicated.'=>'%1$d 模板已成功复制。','%d tags were successfully deleted.'=>'已成功删除 %d 个标签。','%1$d form was successfully restored.'=>'%1$d 表单已成功恢复。','<strong>Email is still #1</strong> - At least 91% of consumers check their email on a daily basis. You get direct access to your subscribers, without having to play by social media\'s rules and algorithms.'=>'<strong>电子邮件依然位居榜首</strong> - 至少91%的消费者每天都会查看电子邮件。您可以直接与订阅者建立联系，无需受社交媒体规则和算法的限制。','Customize the background color of the email template.'=>'自定义电子邮件模板的背景颜色。','Plain Text'=>'纯文本','Load WPForms assets site-wide. Only check if your site is having compatibility issues or instructed to by support.'=>'在整个网站范围内加载 WPForms 资源。仅当您的网站存在兼容性问题或经技术支持人员指示时，才需进行此操作。','Connect your Constant Contact email list.'=>'连接您的 Constant Contact 邮件列表。','Drag and drop any field you want onto your signup form.'=>'将您想要的任何字段拖放到注册表单上。','Select from our pre-built templates, or create a form from scratch.'=>'您可以从我们的现成模板中选择，也可以从头开始创建表单。','When creating WPForms, our goal was to make a WordPress forms plugin that\'s both EASY and POWERFUL.'=>'在开发 WPForms 时，我们的目标是打造一款既简单又强大的 WordPress 表单插件。','WPForms plugin makes it fast and easy to capture all kinds of visitor information right from your WordPress site - even if you don\'t have a Constant Contact account.'=>'WPForms 插件让您能够直接在 WordPress 网站上快速、轻松地收集各类访客信息——即使您没有 Constant Contact 账户。','That\'s why it\'s crucial to start collecting email addresses and building your list as soon as possible.'=>'正因如此，尽早开始收集电子邮箱地址并建立邮件列表至关重要。','<strong>Email converts</strong> - People who buy products marketed through email spend 138% more than those who don\'t receive email offers.'=>'<strong>电子邮件转化率</strong> - 通过电子邮件营销购买产品的消费者，其消费额比未收到电子邮件优惠信息的消费者高出138%。','Multi-page Forms, File Upload Forms, Multiple Form Notifications, File Upload and CSV Attachments, Conditional Form Confirmation, Custom CAPTCHA, Offline Forms, Signature Forms, Save and Resume Form, Coupons'=>'多页表单、文件上传表单、多表单通知、文件上传和 CSV 附件、条件表单确认、自定义验证码、离线表单、签名表单、表单保存与续填、优惠券','<strong>Bonus:</strong> 9000+ integrations with Zapier.'=>'<strong>额外福利：</strong> 与 Zapier 集成超过 9000 种。','All Form Templates including Bonus %s pre-made form templates'=>'所有表单模板，包括额外的 %s 个预制表单模板','Pro'=>'Pro','We know that you will truly love WPForms. It has over <strong>13,000+ five star ratings</strong> (%s) and is active on over 6 million websites.'=>'我们相信您一定会非常喜欢 WPForms。它拥有超过 <strong>13,000+ 条五星评价</strong> (%s)，并在超过 600 万个网站上被广泛使用。','To begin, you’ll need to be logged into the WordPress admin area. Once there, click on WPForms in the admin sidebar to go to the Forms Overview page.'=>'首先，你需要登录到 WordPress 管理区。在那里，点击管理侧边栏中的 WPForms 进入表单概述页面。','Enable Conditional Logic'=>'启用条件逻辑','It doesn\'t matter what kind of business you run, what kind of website you have, or what industry you are in - you need to start building your email list today.'=>'无论您经营什么类型的业务、拥有什么样的网站，还是身处哪个行业 - 您都需要从今天开始建立您的电子邮件订阅列表。','Add your new form to any post, page, or sidebar.'=>'将您的新表单添加到任何文章、页面或侧边栏中。','You need to <a href="#" class="wpforms-panel-switch" data-panel="setup">set up your form</a> before you can manage the fields.'=>'您需要 <a href="#" class="wpforms-panel-switch" data-panel="setup">先设置表单</a>，才能管理表单字段。','WPForms makes it easy for you to switch by allowing you to import your third-party forms with a single click.'=>'WPForms 让您只需单击一下即可导入第三方表单，从而轻松完成切换。','Please enter a valid date.'=>'请输入一个有效的日期。','Import Forms from Other Form Plugins'=>'从其他表单插件导入表单','Drag &amp; Drop Form Builder'=>'拖拽式表单构建器','The blank form allows you to create any type of form using our drag & drop builder.'=>'通过空白表单，您可以使用我们的拖拽式表单构建器创建任何类型的表单。','You don\'t have any fields yet. Add some!'=>'您目前还没有任何字段。请添加一些吧！','You don\'t have any fields yet.'=>'您目前尚未添加任何字段。','Heads up!'=>'注意啦！','Heads Up!'=>'注意啦！','Heads up! Don\'t forget to test your form. <a href="%s" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Check out our complete guide</a>!'=>'注意！别忘了测试你的表单。<a href="%s" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">查看我们的完整指南</a>！','Duplicate'=>'创建副本','Your license key provides access to updates and addons.'=>'您的许可证密钥可让您获取更新和附加组件。','You\'re using WPForms Lite - no license needed. Enjoy!'=>'您正在使用 WPForms Lite - 无需许可证。祝您使用愉快！','As a valued WPForms Lite user you receive <strong>50% off</strong>, automatically applied at checkout!'=>'作为备受珍视的 WPForms Lite 用户，您可享受 <strong>50% 折扣</strong>，结账时将自动适用！','Bonus: WPForms Lite users get <span class="price-20-off">50% off regular price</span>, automatically applied at checkout.'=>'额外优惠：WPForms Lite 用户可享受 <span class="price-20-off">正价五折优惠</span>，结账时自动享受折扣。','Payment is required.'=>'必须完成付款‌。','Manage integrations with popular providers such as Constant Contact, Mailchimp, Zapier, and more.'=>'管理与 Constant Contact、Mailchimp、Zapier 等热门服务商的集成。','Over the years, we found that most WordPress contact form plugins were bloated, buggy, slow, and very hard to use. So we started with a simple goal: build a WordPress forms plugin that’s both easy and powerful.'=>'多年来，我们发现大多数 WordPress 联系表单插件都臃肿、漏洞百出、运行缓慢，而且非常难用。因此，我们从一个简单的目标开始：开发一款既简单又强大的 WordPress 表单插件。','Our goal is to take the pain out of creating online forms and make it easy.'=>'我们的目标是消除制作在线表单的麻烦，让这一过程变得简单。','Yup, we know a thing or two about building awesome products that customers love.'=>'没错，我们对打造深受客户喜爱的高品质产品颇有心得。','WPForms is brought to you by the same team that’s behind the largest WordPress resource site, <a href="%1$s" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">WPBeginner</a>, the most popular lead-generation software, <a href="%2$s" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">OptinMonster</a>, the best WordPress analytics plugin, <a href="%3$s" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">MonsterInsights</a>, and more!'=>'WPForms 由全球最大的 WordPress 资源站点<a href="%1$s" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">WPBeginner</a>、最受欢迎的线索生成软件<a href="%2$s" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">OptinMonster</a>、口碑最佳的 WordPress 数据分析插件<a href="%3$s" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">MonsterInsights</a>背后的同一团队倾力打造！‌','Already purchased?'=>'已经购买？','Install'=>'安装','WPForms Lite'=>'WPForms Lite','WPForms'=>'WPForms','https://wpforms.com'=>'https://wpforms.com','Delete'=>'删除','Upload Image'=>'上传图像','You\'ve just turned off notification emails for this form. Since entries are not stored in WPForms Lite, notification emails are recommended for collecting entry details. For setup steps, <a href="%s" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">please see our notification tutorial</a>.'=>'您刚刚关闭了此表单的通知电子邮件。由于条目不存储在 wpforms lite 中, 因此建议发送通知电子邮件来收集条目详细信息。有关设置步骤, <a href="%s" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer"> 请参阅我们的通知教程 </a>。','You do not have permissions.'=>'您没有权限。','You do not have permission.'=>'您没有权限。','You do not have permission to perform this action.'=>'您无权执行此操作。','You do not have permission'=>'您没有得到许可','You can use WPForms to build contact forms, surveys, payment forms, and more with just a few clicks.'=>'只需点击几下，您就可以使用WPForms构建联系表单、调查表单、付款表单等。','Yes, I give WPForms permission to contact me for any follow up questions.'=>'是的，如果有任何后续问题，我会允许WPForms与我联系。','WPForms honeypot field triggered.'=>'WPForms蜜罐字段已触发。','WPForms Challenge'=>'WPForms 挑战','Website / URL'=>'网站 / URL','View Entries in Dashboard'=>'在仪表板中查看条目','Uploaded files combined size exceeds allowed maximum.'=>'上载的文件总计大小超过了允许的最大值。','Upgrade to WPForms Pro Now'=>'立即升级到WPForms专业版','Upgrade to WPForms Pro'=>'升级至WPForms专业版','Upgrade to Pro and get access to the reports.'=>'升级到专业版并访问报告。','Upgrade to PRO'=>'升级到PRO','Upgrade Now'=>'现在升级','Upgrade'=>'更新','Two Columns'=>'两栏','Total'=>'合计','To display all form fields, use the %s Smart Tag.'=>'要显示所有表单域，请使用%s智能标记。','Three Columns'=>'三栏','Third Choice'=>'第三选择','The default notification settings might be sufficient, but double&#8209;check to be sure.'=>'默认通知设置可能已足够，但请仔细检查确认。','Thanks for contacting us! We will be in touch with you shortly.'=>'谢谢您联络我们！我们会尽